x:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_JonesTradingNoteMember_yEPF87kk6EO8c5kxTsNf9g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_o9Tbao6u4kG111_PCB-jVQ">375,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> (the &#8220;JonesTrading Note&#8221;) at a price per share of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_JonesTradingNoteMember_Fvi7m-JF0kqF7Z48lmXYIQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_C_LTujifPUm0Gim3tHGROg">2.00</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. Accrued interest on the JonesTrading Note is payable monthly, beginning on June 30, 2024, at a rate of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_JonesTradingNoteMember_Fvi7m-JF0kqF7Z48lmXYIQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_9hSoj7pGkkKQ5jSNr8YVfw">13</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> per annum. Until all payments have been made to the Wilson-Davis Sellers, interest on the Interest Solutions Note may be paid in cash or shares of Common Stock valued at the then-current conversion price. Thereafter, all accrued interest must be paid in cash. As of June 30, 2024, the amount is included in Promissory note payable.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:36pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Winston &amp; Strawn LLP &#8211; up to </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_WinstonStrawnLlpMember_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_eIZsp7ntKEmJVXUKzAcv_g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:NumberOfSharesIssuableForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_YG9r6yevi0Svln1PIWvk6w">2,500,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> in shares of Common Stock that may become issuable to Winston &amp; Strawn LLP (&#8220;Winston &amp; Strawn&#8221;), pursuant to a subscription agreement, dated as of February 9, 2024, between Winston &amp; Strawn and the Company (the &#8220;Winston &amp; Strawn Agreement&#8221;). Pursuant to the Winston Agreement, the Company may issue </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_WinstonStrawnLlpMember_26qCdzbJckamRRRSZ4ITLw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ValueOfSharesIssuableForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_ZBNgLUG1w0uMSziLWT41sQ">2,500,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> worth of shares of Common Stock as payment for legal services, in </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_installment_naZ3LCjrPUCQHLaJ5sTEcg" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_WinstonStrawnLlpMember_lPi19Ubt7kK9uqz3Jg6Ppw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:NumberOfInstallments" scale="0" id="Narr_i2L6b5CiTE-o5-Imr_Ggrg">three</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> equal installments of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_WinstonStrawnLlpMember_26qCdzbJckamRRRSZ4ITLw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ValueOfSharesIssuableForServicesInEachInstallment" scale="0" id="Narr_KpjgIQXqv0G0d-D_7JNoqA">833,333</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> beginning on August 9, 2024. As of June 30, 2024, the amount is included in Subscription agreement as an liability of $</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_WinstonStrawnLlpMember_jZXBN43BSky5-B5u6oFAMQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:SubscriptionPayableLiabilityNoncurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_JSIogrIlFUqtbafEy7rNKQ">2,425,647</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. Due to the nature of the settlement terms, the subreption agreement was deemed to be a derivative liability to the Company as of June 30, 2024 under ASC 480. Change in fair value of the subscription agreement are measured at each reporting period with change reported in earnings. See valuation approach and further disclosure on Note 19.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:36pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Toppan Merrill LLC &#8211; the Company issued to Toppan Merrill LLC (&#8220;Toppan&#8221;) a promissory note, dated as of February 9, 2024, in the aggregate principal amount of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ToppanNoteMember_AyGLS-4Yr0G6J4yRxtCHOw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr__8F_X-aPGU6ktcHVHNgPDw">160,025</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> (the &#8220;Toppan Note&#8221;). The maturity date of the Toppan Note is February 8, 2026 and the note accrues interest at a rate of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ToppanNoteMember_AyGLS-4Yr0G6J4yRxtCHOw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_ZSf80ehQw0az3CgjcfUhMg">13</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> per annum. The principal and interest payments due under the note is not payable in shares of Common Stock. As of June 30, 2024, the amount is included in Promissory note payable.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:36pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Lead Nectar &#8211; up to </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_LeadNectarMember_1D_tqd4KHkCzJM62gglhwA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:NumberOfSharesIssuableForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_q7vMV160Pk-uYk8rTgW_Lg">12,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> shares of Common Stock that may become issuable to Lead Nectar in lieu of payment for internet marketing services in the amount of $</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_LeadNectarMember_1D_tqd4KHkCzJM62gglhwA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ValueOfSharesPayableForInternetMarketingServices" scale="0" id="Narr_V3gXkEVSAEyUNvHtjsDmoQ">20,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. Shares were issued after June 30, 2024.</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:12pt;"></div></ix:continuation></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-20</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_09EvmVJl5ECjl2ShuIGO0Q_cont3" continuedAt="Tb_09EvmVJl5ECjl2ShuIGO0Q_cont4"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Excise Taxes Payable</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On February 6, 2023, the Company&#8217;s stockholders redeemed <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_2_6_2023_To_2_6_2023_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_IiVBtSx0HEea15FYlJEUZQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:TemporaryEquityStockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodShares" scale="0" id="Narr_PrDTgMRNtEqFHlkLZlMOaA">14,667,626</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock for a total of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_6_2023_To_2_6_2023_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_IiVBtSx0HEea15FYlJEUZQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:TemporaryEquityStockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodValue" scale="0" id="Narr_OrAbd6jQsEqJkhhe14OL9Q">148,523,642</ix:nonFraction>. On August 4, 2023, the Company&#8217;s stockholders redeemed <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_8_4_2023_To_8_4_2023_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_X9Xe_XHIokKS4Be8gnNZyA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:TemporaryEquityStockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodShares" scale="0" id="Narr_9wAzcuGI0E6AjBFVYlg8yg">406,990</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock for a total of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_8_4_2023_To_8_4_2023_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_X9Xe_XHIokKS4Be8gnNZyA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodValue" scale="0" id="Narr_bnqLJ3l-VU6iwr-cl84hGA">4,286,537</ix:nonFraction>. On February 9, 2024, the Company&#8217;s stockholders redeemed <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_v6ZdKJSN8EeTX_VMXptucg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:TemporaryEquityStockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodShares" scale="0" id="Narr_ahT-L73h9U6_XHj32FbObA">4,940,885</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock for a total of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_v6ZdKJSN8EeTX_VMXptucg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodValue" scale="0" id="Narr_e-fRW-Ed3EOV23gLR0_2QA">53,947,064</ix:nonFraction>. The Company evaluated the classification and accounting of the excise tax related to these stock redemptions under ASC 450, &#8220;Contingencies&#8221;. ASC 450 states that when a loss contingency exists the likelihood that the future event(s) will confirm the loss or impairment of an asset, or the incurrence of a liability can range from probable to remote. A contingent liability must be reviewed at each reporting period to determine appropriate treatment. The Company evaluated the current status and probability of completing a Business Combination as of September 30, 2023 and determined that a contingent liability should be calculated and recorded. As of June 30, 2024, December 31, 2023, the Company recorded $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_i2gUnkY77UuxcoehQ3RXew" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SalesAndExciseTaxPayableCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_J81njaDCNEGAaWy5Pp287g">2,067,572</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_KYb5iRFWfEiJ9nfWH1sHBA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SalesAndExciseTaxPayableCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_2I151pgtuk2nyJyqWm8E1Q">1,528,101</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, of excise tax liability calculated as <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtTypeAxis_atch_ExciseTaxesPayableMember_uBwj7AQhzUWRZZaFUU8jdQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ExciseTaxLiabilitySharesRedeemedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_4V3Xygmeu0ypzf8TgUXQDw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtTypeAxis_atch_ExciseTaxesPayableMember_nnWVs76rH0mYlnkUQcs1dw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ExciseTaxLiabilitySharesRedeemedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_HafI-T4Wtkurcm1YcJEjmA">1</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>% of shares redeemed.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Secured Convertible Note Financing</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On February 9, 2024, Wilson-Davis and Quantum entered into a securities purchase agreement (the &#8220;Purchase Agreement&#8221;) with Funicular Funds, LP, a Delaware limited partnership (&#8220;Funicular&#8221;), pursuant to which the Company sold and issued to Funicular, on that date, a secured convertible promissory note in the principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_L2ZD_wqbjkuChlUa2ZN_MA">6,000,000</ix:nonFraction> (the &#8220;Funicular Note&#8221;) for a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_wFzhwzJNl0u3uSs7EAKljQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromNotesPayable" scale="0" id="Narr_yc0EIoSXJkiipa3k0H-Lrg">6,000,000</ix:nonFraction>, in a private placement (the &#8220;Secured Note Financing&#8221;). The proceeds raised in the Note Financing were used to pay a portion of the purchase price paid at Closing to the Wilson-Davis Sellers.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Funicular Note has a stated maturity date of November 9, 2025. Interest accrues at a rate per annum equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_shFOcgRteEm1-7yecVOBGQ">12.5</ix:nonFraction>%, and is payable semi-annually on each June 30 and December 31. On each interest payment date, the accrued and unpaid interest shall, at the election of the Company in its sole discretion, be either paid in cash or paid in-kind by increasing the principal amount of the Funicular Note. In the event of an Event of Default (as defined in the Funicular Note), in addition to Funicular&#8217;s other rights and remedies, the interest rate would increase to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentInterestRateInEventOfDefault" scale="-2" id="Narr_Q_nQyHg3I0Of5qI-6jdC7A">20</ix:nonFraction>% per annum. The Funicular Note is convertible, in whole or in part, into shares of Common Stock at the election of the holder at any time at an initial conversion price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" scale="0" id="Narr_YtTVnuz9J0W9spmgxHu-Rg">10.00</ix:nonFraction> per share (the &#8220;Conversion Price&#8221;). The Conversion Price is subject to adjustment monthly to a price equal to the trailing <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_LQ4M5hqi1EqO2C4N7zkpIw" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_wFzhwzJNl0u3uSs7EAKljQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleThresholdTradingDaysOverWhichVolumeWeightedAverageStockPriceConsideredForMonthlyAdjustmentsToConversionPrice" scale="0" id="Narr_yRyljIbRCESVDRZuhdf4Eg">five</ix:nonFraction>-day VWAP, subject to a floor of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPriceFloor" scale="0" id="Narr_H3habhAzMUuoGTbDEof5MA">2.00</ix:nonFraction> per share (provided that if the Company sells stock at an effective price below $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_-Qg53XBXPU6DYpY3lWSBmA">2.00</ix:nonFraction> per share, such floor would be reduced to such effective price), and is subject to customary adjustments for stock dividends, stock splits, reclassifications and the like. The Company has the right to redeem the Funicular Note upon <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_wFzhwzJNl0u3uSs7EAKljQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:DebtInstrumentRedemptionNumberOfDaysNotice" id="Narr_PzJqkc0_lUObV4miQDNgiw">30 days</ix:nonNumeric>&#8217; notice after the earlier of August 7, 2024 and the effectiveness of the Registration Statement (as defined in the Funicular Note), and Funicular would have the right to require the Company to redeem the Note in connection with a Change of Control (as defined in the Note), in each case for a price equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_wFzhwzJNl0u3uSs7EAKljQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentRedemptionPricePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_tzFTTn2IgE6U_fNCy9Ndlg">101</ix:nonFraction>% of the outstanding principal amount of the Note plus accrued and unpaid interest. The Funicular Note contains covenants which, among other things, limit the ability of the Company and its subsidiaries to incur additional indebtedness, incur additional liens and sell its assets or properties.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Funicular Note is secured by a perfected security interest in substantially all of the existing and future assets of the Company and each Grantor (as defined in the Security Agreement, as defined below), including a pledge of all of the capital stock of each of the Grantors, subject to certain exceptions, as evidenced by (i) a security agreement, dated as of February 9, 2024 (the &#8220;Security Agreement&#8221;), entered into among the Company, each of the Company&#8217;s subsidiaries and Funicular, and (ii) a guaranty, dated as of February 9, 2024 (the &#8220;Guaranty&#8221;), executed by each of the Company&#8217;s subsidiaries pursuant to which each of them has agreed to guaranty the obligations of the Company under the Funicular Note and the other Loan Documents (as defined in the Funicular Note).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Pursuant to the Purchase Agreement, the Company agreed, among other things, that if the Funicular Note becomes convertible into a number of shares of Common Stock in excess of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleThresholdMaximumPercentageOfOutstandingCommonStockAboveWhichStockholderApprovalIsRequired" scale="-2" id="Narr_T9Z6olpkg06dvA3CoJgfAQ">19.9</ix:nonFraction>% of the Company&#8217;s total number of shares of Common Stock outstanding, to seek the approval of its stockholders for the issuance of all shares of Common Stock issuable upon conversion of the Funicular Note in excess of that amount, in accordance with the rules of the NYSE American. Also pursuant to the Purchase Agreement, at the Closing the Sponsor transferred <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_atch_SponsorMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_atch_FounderSharesMember_NckYQwV-eEyQ59Q9adoh2g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:NumberOfWarrantsTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_4AQg_sBeZki2pxETQ1ukeQ">600,000</ix:nonFraction> Founder Shares and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_atch_SponsorMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_w5e-GoT5sEmBNYdhMpQW6g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:NumberOfWarrantsTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_Tj9HPsUzDkqnZQ-5SYW1Lg">600,000</ix:nonFraction> Private Warrants to Funicular, which transfers terminated Quantum&#8217;s obligation to issue shares to Funicular pursuant to the terms of the non-redemption agreement, dated August 1, 2023, between Quantum and Funicular. The purchase price was allocated on a relative fair value basis resulting in the allocated value of the warrants transferred at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_atch_SponsorMember_mip3MC5j3Emx9ttt8PU7PQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ValueOfWarrantsIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_qI3YMGOrMU6dfavnUnJe7A">28,496</ix:nonFraction> and the value of the shares transferred at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_atch_SponsorMember_mip3MC5j3Emx9ttt8PU7PQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_GjNSjczJ3Um2uWml5uJckQ">1,222,202</ix:nonFraction> for a total discount to the note value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_atch_SponsorMember_mip3MC5j3Emx9ttt8PU7PQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AdjustmentsToAdditionalPaidInCapitalValueOfSharesTransferredAsPurchasePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_tVde7UbSuEqI5PJ3rtg2sA">1,250,698</ix:nonFraction> recorded as additional paid in capital for the equity components granted.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">In connection with the Note Financing, on February 9, 2024, the Company entered into a registration rights agreement with Funicular (the &#8220;Funicular Registration Rights Agreement&#8221;), pursuant to which the Company agreed, among other things, to file with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_wFzhwzJNl0u3uSs7EAKljQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:PeriodToFileRegistrationStatementWithSec" id="Narr_-FnBK35M5E6bcwKs83Ytxg">15 days</ix:nonNumeric> after the Closing Date a registration statement registering the resale of the shares of Common Stock issuable upon exercise of the Funicular Note (the &#8220;Funicular Registration Statement&#8221;), and the Company agreed to </p></ix:continuation></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-21</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_09EvmVJl5ECjl2ShuIGO0Q_cont4" continuedAt="Tb_09EvmVJl5ECjl2ShuIGO0Q_cont5"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">use its best efforts to have the Funicular Registration Statement declared effective as promptly as reasonably possible after the filing thereof, but in any event within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_wFzhwzJNl0u3uSs7EAKljQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:NumberOfDaysWithinWhichRegistrationStatementShouldBeDeclaredEffective" id="Narr_BQRKtypfFk6wOn48WZmDog">60 days</ix:nonNumeric> of the Closing Date. If the registration statement is not filed within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_fGwcjU1I102YJQ8732FGSg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:PeriodToFileRegistrationStatementWithSec" id="Narr_bH8WFWEoFUuuM1Q9xkVLEg">30 days</ix:nonNumeric> after the Closing or is not declared effective by the applicable deadline set forth in the Registration Rights Agreement, or under certain other circumstances described in the Registration Rights Agreement, then the Company shall be obligated to pay to the Buyer an amount in cash equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:PercentageOfOriginalPrincipalAmountOfNotesPayableUponDefaultOfFilingOrEffectingOfRegistrationStatementWithSec" scale="-2" id="Narr_zXDzdx17a06-CaGYV29KUw">5</ix:nonFraction>% of the original principal amount of the Note on a monthly basis until the applicable event giving rise to such payments is cured. The Funicular Registration Rights Agreement also provides that the Company is obligated to file additional registration statements under certain circumstances, and provides Funicular with customary &#8220;piggyback&#8221; registration rights.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">As a result of the delay in filing the registration statement the Company incurred $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_Lm9US_Lk-ki7iTJmSDhqrQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtIssuanceCosts" scale="0" id="Narr_pzyA2EwB5kW7d4pY8c98VA">1,500,000</ix:nonFraction> in fees through June 30, 2024 which has been added to the principal of the note. As of June 30, 2024, the company recognized $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_z-mg2s9h00eu-SC2jStizA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AccruedInterestExpensePrincipalAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_xhoAT1STxESpTP205rCTwQ">328,767</ix:nonFraction> in interest expense on the principal and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_z-mg2s9h00eu-SC2jStizA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AccruedInterestExpenseAmortizationOfDebtDiscount" scale="0" id="Narr_ZqJZKAOg9kq5ubhBlKvzvQ">279,032</ix:nonFraction> of interest related to the amortization of the debt discount described above. As of June 30, 2024 the carrying value of the notes is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_NonrelatedPartyMember_NSsojneLEE2wC-AZyfdN0A" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SecuredDebtCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_Ej9SMACk3kOsSg7_EK6Fpg">6,857,101</ix:nonFraction> net of discount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_i2gUnkY77UuxcoehQ3RXew" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscountPremiumNet" scale="0" id="Narr_fnJzpY1ADUaZ4AxO7o4YtA">971,666</ix:nonFraction>.<br/><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Sellers Note</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As described in note 11 below, (i) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermNotesMember_nYbnF4iAkEaBhpOEdZhDNg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_GhJ4ux8MzkiLz-BSH3CLBg">5,000,000</ix:nonFraction> in aggregate principal amount of notes due <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermNotesMember_GV-WVXMMnEClCIsE5pFYNQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm" id="Narr_CLgBvFY6YU6y9bhT9dBI4w">90 days</ix:nonNumeric> after the Closing Date (the &#8220;Short-Term Notes&#8221;) and (ii) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_AtHhdO1dskuOq0-eE8jopA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_gMCsQ4RiSU2OzjF97CpeLQ">7,971,000</ix:nonFraction> in aggregate principal amount of notes due <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_gaRrnmN5KkiI4ZTCTzeSdQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm" id="Narr_p9AKtgJKfUqn_xKWyDhWXA">24 months</ix:nonNumeric> after the Closing Date (the &#8220;Long-Term Notes&#8221; and, together with the Short-Term Notes, the &#8220;Seller Notes&#8221;). The Short-Term Notes accrue interest at a rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermNotesMember_nYbnF4iAkEaBhpOEdZhDNg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_jjFsUhv6wUC3bkXIK34etA">9</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, payable quarterly in arrears, in shares of Common Stock at a rate equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermNotesMember_GV-WVXMMnEClCIsE5pFYNQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentInterestPayableInSharesAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice" scale="-2" id="Narr_oDRcdClX5E-JIicWIqapSg">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the trailing seven-trading day VWAP prior to payment (or, at the Company&#8217;s option, cash), and are convertible at the option of the holder at any time during the continuance of an event of default, at a rate equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermNotesMember_GV-WVXMMnEClCIsE5pFYNQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRateAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice.IfEventOfDefaultOccursAndIsContinuing" scale="-2" id="Narr_xHuQ2mkEA0OSbZn7nexb8w">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the trailing seven-trading day VWAP prior to conversion. The Long-Term Notes accrue interest at a rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_AtHhdO1dskuOq0-eE8jopA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_ggzozYsNXE2aYUE9OlQl6w">13</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, payable quarterly in arrears, in shares of Common Stock at a rate equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_gaRrnmN5KkiI4ZTCTzeSdQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRateAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice" scale="-2" id="Narr_kzq-3638EE6f1nWYx0ejWg">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the trailing seven-trading day VWAP prior to payment (or, at the Company&#8217;s option, in cash), and are convertible at the option of the holder at any time commencing six months after the Closing Date, at a rate equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_gaRrnmN5KkiI4ZTCTzeSdQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRateAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice" scale="-2" id="Narr_Bywv2V8PjEm2GV0eP82uuw">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the trailing seven-trading day VWAP prior to conversion (or <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_gaRrnmN5KkiI4ZTCTzeSdQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRateAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice.IfEventOfDefaultOccursAndIsContinuing" scale="-2" id="Narr_Ho0uJzXd00C2pGbb3WP-aw">85</ix:nonFraction>% if an event of default occurs and is continuing).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Under ASC 815 the conversion feature was bifurcated resulting in a conversion liability of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermNotesMember_us-gaap_FairValueByLiabilityClassAxis_us-gaap_DerivativeFinancialInstrumentsLiabilitiesMember_CU9Z713tn0S2aoYH_NgFxw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationRecurringBasisLiabilityIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_d4AwHwOLwkuzC_iPk8H-Pg">487,329</ix:nonFraction> for the short term loan and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_us-gaap_FairValueByLiabilityClassAxis_us-gaap_DerivativeFinancialInstrumentsLiabilitiesMember_VfGe3zC9BEam0rbEb1q5fg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationRecurringBasisLiabilityIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_ArECIaoxA0yM6fM6s9Dgfg">776,919</ix:nonFraction> for the long-term loan at issuance. As of June 30, 2024, the company recognized $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermNotesMember_JD1V1fsVsU-XCjK2yplmcg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AccruedInterestExpensePrincipalAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_7wFzqDVT8EShMrhBXbravw">610,440</ix:nonFraction> in interest expense on the principal and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_FiKYA4U18E29nwCYUH3QdA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AccruedInterestExpenseAmortizationOfDebtDiscount" scale="0" id="Narr_t47fn8MCvEucJ9FSP6SRPg">640,555</ix:nonFraction> of interest related to the amortization of the debt discount created with the derivative liability. See Note 19 for additional information on the fair value of the derivative.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Subscription Agreement and Satisfaction and Discharge Agreement </b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On February 9, 2024, the Registrant entered into a Subscription Agreement (the &#8220;Subscription Agreement&#8221;) and Satisfaction and Discharge Agreement (&#8220;Discharge Agreement&#8221;) with Winston &amp; Strawn LLP (&#8220;Winston&#8221;), Calculator New Pubco, Inc. and Quantum. The Registrant accepted the offer of Winston to subscribe for an aggregate of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_WinstonStrawnLlpMember_26qCdzbJckamRRRSZ4ITLw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_zzU5UfL-oESEHpWvbTBknQ">2.5</ix:nonFraction> million worth of shares of its common stock in lieu of fees accrued prior to the Business Combination. In accordance with the Discharge Agreement, Winston, the service provider, has irrevocably waived their rights to receive the professional fees for the Prior Services in cash and has agreed to the Company tendering the full amount of the Fees in cash at Closing, Winston accept common stock of the Post-Closing Company as satisfaction of the Fees. As a result of the Discharge Agreement, Winston has legally released the Company from being the primary obligor under the liability. As a result, the Company has concluded that such liabilities are no longer an obligation of the Company and therefore qualify for extinguishment. The Subscription Agreement is considered a variable-share obligation under ASC Topic 480 (&#8220;Distinguishing Liabilities from Equity&#8221;). The Subscription Agreement meets the requirements for classification under ASC 480 and as a result is required to be accounted for as a liability under ASC 480 and is presented as such on the Consolidated Balance Sheets. The Company will record a change in fair value on each reporting period until settlement in its Consolidated Statement of Operations. See foot note 19 for additional disclosures. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Indemnification Agreements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On the Closing Date, in connection with the Closing, the Company entered into indemnification agreements with each of its directors and executive officers, which provide for indemnification and advancements by the Company of certain expenses and costs under certain circumstances. The indemnification agreements provide that AtlasClear Holdings will indemnify each of its directors and executive officers against any and all expenses incurred by that director or executive officer because of his or her status as a director or officer of AtlasClear Holdings, to the fullest extent permitted by Delaware law, the Amended and Restated Certificate of Incorporation and the Amended and Restated Bylaws.</p></ix:continuation></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-22</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_09EvmVJl5ECjl2ShuIGO0Q_cont5"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Wilson-Davis </b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On February 27, 2018, an extended hearing panel of the Department of Enforcement of the Financial Industry Regulatory Authority, Inc. (&#8220;FINRA&#8221;), Office of Hearing Officers, issued its decision ordering fines aggregating $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_27_2018_To_2_27_2018_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_WilsonDavisCoIncMember_1r7g4aLK40WF7NIV1DHMiA" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LossContingencyDamagesAwardedValue" scale="6" id="Narr_8B-L55tj9UCb1BAmsyovGw">1.47</ix:nonFraction> million for violations of the applicable short sales and anti-money laundering rules. Wilson-Davis appealed the decision to the National Adjudicatory Council (&#8220;NAC&#8221;). On December 19, 2019, NAC issued its decision ordering that the fines be reduced by $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_12_19_2019_To_12_19_2019_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_WilsonDavisCoIncMember_FhL9zLpBy0aMhIh48QWg4g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:LossContingencyReductionInDamageAwarded" scale="0" id="Narr_4f8znVgnE0adqVsMhs470g">205,000</ix:nonFraction> to an aggregate $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_12_19_2019_To_12_19_2019_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_WilsonDavisCoIncMember_FhL9zLpBy0aMhIh48QWg4g" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LossContingencyDamagesAwardedValue" scale="6" id="Narr_MYszhiVWBUuRa8pdl77zPw">1.265</ix:nonFraction> million. Wilson-Davis made a timely appeal to the SEC to hear the case. Pursuant to FINRA rules, Wilson-Davis&#8217;s timely appeal of the decision to the SEC deferred the effectiveness of the findings and sanctions. Due to the disparity in the range of fines of similar cases, Wilson-Davis believes that the final amount is not reasonably estimable. Wilson-Davis has booked a contingent liability totaling $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_12_19_2019_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_WilsonDavisCoIncMember_vUD_8MBUDUW7qc_iO5rQpw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LitigationReserveNoncurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_uvWuWgqkz0evHN1HNobVqw">100,000</ix:nonFraction>, which represents the estimated low end of the possible range of fines. On December 28, 2023, the SEC issued an Opinion sustaining FINRA&#8217;s findings of violations against Wilson-Davis. The Opinion set aside the fines FINRA imposed on Wilson-Davis for the Reg SHO violations and the supervisory and AML violations. The SEC remanded the case to FINRA to reconsider the appropriate sanctions.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On October 16, 2023, Wilson-Davis entered into a Fifth Addendum to Lease for the Salt Lake City office. The lease is for <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_10_16_2023_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_WilsonDavisCoIncMember_us-gaap_LeaseContractualTermAxis_atch_LeaseForSaltLakeCityOfficeMember_oqO6X-vTmUOXr32FKzNrzg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseTermOfContract" id="Narr_GJziwRy4EE-zX1xMB0OJXw">three years</ix:nonNumeric>. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On December 21, 2023, Wilson-Davis entered into a Second Amendment to Office Lease for the Denver office. The lease is for <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_12_21_2023_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_WilsonDavisCoIncMember_us-gaap_LeaseContractualTermAxis_atch_OfficeLeaseForDenverOfficeMember__wEkXxjVpE6wTVm3xr4lQg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseTermOfContract" id="Narr_jWRs7e01MUqw-VCLykzcjw">one year</ix:nonNumeric>.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024__Cb2ny4KYUqeIsx0xgHwEg" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_vTYLq4S28EqUVbxWDc5Lmw" continuedAt="Tb_vTYLq4S28EqUVbxWDc5Lmw_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTE&#160;11. ACQUISITION OF WILSON-DAVIS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Prior to the Closing, AtlasClear and the Company entered into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_q_emrF2abUS8TFnpzcOZrQ" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_hkg-r-fAYkKc6nGBsQkTzw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:BusinessCombinationNumberOfAmendmentsToBrokerDealerAcquisitionAgreement" scale="0" id="Narr_AvRH96WqzkGtiIP8LMK3Gg">two</ix:nonFraction> amendments to the Broker-Dealer Acquisition Agreement with Wilson-Davis and the then-owners of Wilson-Davis (the &#8220;Wilson-Davis Sellers&#8221;), Amendment No. 8 dated January 9, 2024 (&#8220;Amendment No. 8&#8221;) and Amendment No. 9 dated February 7, 2024 (&#8220;Amendment No. 9&#8221; and, together with Amendment No. 8, the &#8220;Amendments&#8221;). Among other things, the Amendments reduced the total purchase price payable under the Broker- Dealer Acquisition Agreement by $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_hkg-r-fAYkKc6nGBsQkTzw" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationProvisionalInformationInitialAccountingIncompleteAdjustmentConsiderationTransferred" scale="6" id="Narr_J-hOibz3hE-I5OKQG17Dqg">5</ix:nonFraction> million and reduced the cash payable at the Wilson-Davis Closing as part of the purchase price to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_hkg-r-fAYkKc6nGBsQkTzw" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireBusinessesGross" scale="6" id="Narr_0lEIVo6bp02txD3L3sMzTQ">8</ix:nonFraction> million, with the balance of the purchase price paid in the form of convertible promissory notes issued by AtlasClear to the Wilson-Davis Sellers, as follows: (i) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtMember_mo6nul-MiUqvES5N_hdSyA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredLiabilitiesIncurred" scale="0" id="Narr_vv4bokX1V0m_zJMCfzAvEg">5,000,000</ix:nonFraction> in aggregate principal amount of notes due <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtMember_mo6nul-MiUqvES5N_hdSyA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm" id="Narr_1CyeaQFITkGawTVn6uV25Q">90 days</ix:nonNumeric> after the Closing Date (the &#8220;Short-Term Notes&#8221;) and (ii) <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_kWmr0ymgGEe-iUqgAQPZVg;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$7,971,000</span></span> in aggregate principal amount of notes due <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_LongTermDebtMember_knuycsqVdEmLAnui7IS5Cg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm" id="Narr_K_WoWN10fk-U6aheOPWz5Q">24 months</ix:nonNumeric> after the Closing Date (the &#8220;Long-Term Notes&#8221; and, together with the Short-Term Notes, the &#8220;Seller Notes&#8221;). The Short-Term Notes accrue interest at a rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtMember_NoM3K4q6y0yMAb4b67wjkA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_F6_JLgYBsE6HiY7ncexOSA">9</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, payable quarterly in arrears, in shares of Common Stock at a rate equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtMember_mo6nul-MiUqvES5N_hdSyA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentInterestPayableInSharesAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice" scale="-2" id="Narr_ZzwMQYhDzEG6Qy5n53uvpA">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the trailing <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_LQ4M5hqi1EqO2C4N7zkpIw" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtMember_mo6nul-MiUqvES5N_hdSyA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRateNumberOfTradingDaysOverWhichVolumeWeightedAverageSharePriceIsConsidered" scale="0" id="Narr_mD6Ev5gjbk2HJnfE3W9qdw">seven</ix:nonFraction>-trading day VWAP prior to payment (or, at the Company&#8217;s option, cash), and are convertible at the option of the holder at any time during the continuance of an event of default, at a rate equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtMember_mo6nul-MiUqvES5N_hdSyA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentInterestPayableInSharesAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice" scale="-2" id="Narr_6wCfTG-9c06Tm9YW96W6Vw">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the trailing <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_LQ4M5hqi1EqO2C4N7zkpIw" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtMember_mo6nul-MiUqvES5N_hdSyA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRateNumberOfTradingDaysOverWhichVolumeWeightedAverageSharePriceIsConsidered" scale="0" id="Narr_jTpANCfyA0yvFnf2fURH8A">seven</ix:nonFraction>-trading day VWAP prior to conversion. The Long-Term Notes accrue interest at a rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_LongTermDebtMember_Mk7cj2cd9UOyEdua4ue4Pg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_YNJTv3kiHUaIAYsT8XNyVA">13</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, payable quarterly in arrears, in shares of Common Stock at a rate equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_LongTermDebtMember_knuycsqVdEmLAnui7IS5Cg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentInterestPayableInSharesAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice" scale="-2" id="Narr_h1jNgEYihkKGH0WhuLC4wg">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the trailing <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_LQ4M5hqi1EqO2C4N7zkpIw" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_LongTermDebtMember_knuycsqVdEmLAnui7IS5Cg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRateNumberOfTradingDaysOverWhichVolumeWeightedAverageSharePriceIsConsidered" scale="0" id="Narr_aV7HVv9-3kSR6d09TW74DA">seven</ix:nonFraction>-trading day VWAP prior to payment (or, at the Company&#8217;s option, in cash), and are convertible at the option of the holder at any time commencing <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_hkg-r-fAYkKc6nGBsQkTzw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:ConversionTermAtOptionOfHolderAfterClosingDate" id="Narr_n4Jcv-0xkEGL-raO7cukbw">six months</ix:nonNumeric> after the Closing Date, at a rate equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_LongTermDebtMember_knuycsqVdEmLAnui7IS5Cg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRateAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice" scale="-2" id="Narr_WNg3CvDCQEKclT7xjY-1ew">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the trailing <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_LQ4M5hqi1EqO2C4N7zkpIw" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_LongTermDebtMember_knuycsqVdEmLAnui7IS5Cg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRateNumberOfTradingDaysOverWhichVolumeWeightedAverageSharePriceIsConsidered" scale="0" id="Narr_jhhry8-suUuLQrsA54i8zQ">seven</ix:nonFraction>-trading day VWAP prior to conversion (or <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_LongTermDebtMember_knuycsqVdEmLAnui7IS5Cg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRateAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice.IfEventOfDefaultOccursAndIsContinuing" scale="-2" id="Narr_MwhTu2Mba0-ndWt1XX6Hfw">85</ix:nonFraction>% if an event of default occurs and is continuing). As of May 9, 2024 the short-term notes became due, as such the interest rate increase to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_5_9_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_LongTermDebtMember_jUkQ-mVlAE2In-E6ovIWPQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_hraQtnyjbEKVStMVeu4XSQ">13</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, payable quarterly in arrears.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Pursuant to the terms of the Amendments, at the closing of the transactions contemplated by the Broker-Dealer Acquisition Agreement (the &#8220;Wilson-Davis Closing&#8221;) the Company entered into a parent guaranty and registration rights agreement with the Wilson-Davis Sellers (the &#8220;Wilson-Davis Guaranty and RRA&#8221;), pursuant to which the Company guaranteed the obligations of AtlasClear under the Notes.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Sponsor also entered into Amendment No. 9, for the limited purpose of agreeing to transfer certain Founder Shares owned by the Sponsor to the Wilson-Davis Sellers. The Sponsor agreed to transfer to the Wilson-Davis Sellers, at the Wilson-Davis Closing, Founder Shares having an aggregate value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_5wmOZVwpBEO5_Fkl0kcpqA" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AggregateValueOfFounderSharesAgreedToTransfer" scale="6" id="Narr_OI9eDy6FFEW3LiRSRZXaIQ">6</ix:nonFraction> million, based on the VWAP of Quantum Common Stock for the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_LQ4M5hqi1EqO2C4N7zkpIw" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_yRXNt-oA2U6ee6yaQ3L20g" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:NumberOfTradingDaysOverWhichVolumeWeightedAverageSharePriceOfCommonStockConsideredForDeterminationOfFounderSharesAgreedToTransfer" scale="0" id="Narr_97FEf2YTkkaZGGyEe5tHWw">five</ix:nonFraction> trading days immediately prior to the Wilson-Davis Closing, which resulted in the transfer of an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_yRXNt-oA2U6ee6yaQ3L20g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:NumberOfFounderSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_1JhAfKosAkK1IRp9gvsmCA">885,010</ix:nonFraction> Founder Shares at the Closing to cover the cash deficit of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_yRXNt-oA2U6ee6yaQ3L20g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ValueOfFounderSharesTransferredToCoverCashDeficit" scale="0" id="Narr_Xrym_I4tk0uApz_9q8oP1g">4,000,000</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_yRXNt-oA2U6ee6yaQ3L20g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ValueOfFounderSharesTransferredToCoverBonusPaidAsConsideration" scale="0" id="Narr_QOd5SkMsPEWKE8bA1BRMaw">2,000,000</ix:nonFraction> bonus paid as consideration. The share transfer from Founder was accounted for as contributed capital and recorded in additional paid in capital. From time to time prior to the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_yRXNt-oA2U6ee6yaQ3L20g" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:TermWithinWhichAdditionalFounderSharesCanBeTransferred" id="Narr_Gsibbc6wEEqAplFlarPtXg">six month</ix:nonNumeric> anniversary of the Closing, the Sponsor may be required to transfer additional Founder Shares to the Wilson-Davis Sellers, as set forth in Amendment No. 9, provided that in no event will the Sponsor be required to transfer more than an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_2_7_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_5wmOZVwpBEO5_Fkl0kcpqA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:MaximumNumberOfFounderSharesThatCanBeTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_y0AUjOPFEUK8oX3avOXcVQ">2,500,000</ix:nonFraction> Founder Shares (including the Founder Shares transferred at the Closing).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">As a result of the closing of the business combination the Company allocated the purchase price with the acquisition of Wilson-Davis under the acquisition method of accounting. The final allocation of the purchase consideration for the Mergers will be determined after </p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-23</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);min-height:11.5pt;"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><a id="Tc_MXAnFrp3e0W5U4Z22hiIiQ_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_HrAPXVp7_kuxagI6e4tAtQ_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_wXOHBIpsE0uDRHcgDXVNYw_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_tkIywGq2yUSE_fFGsydCMw_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_CqkblsUW906ITSK_-Nyaww_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_XAn6aDhPYkeB_F17MMbY5g_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_jDehbbmXiEGA0kWY7kQkxg_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_5A63VosBM0CPWKErk_tBfQ_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_-EFc_EtUQkKKlAhzVx5elA_8_2"></a><a id="Tc_ziKSTvBphE2ZxGmdtJD1sQ_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_y4ifK7iBR0O-Qd7ZwBc6YA_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_kWXnSfw3dkG7kxTFSLxn6A_11_0"></a><a id="Tc_guchXqOAK0uBvzQgzb1TrA_12_0"></a><a id="Tc_QQ1NQKeCRUa5m-IJBSYJfw_13_0"></a><a id="Tc_2ezTtNGu2EGLuowW7dzVcg_14_0"></a><a id="Tc_H1DnCGdrdU2uUypIufA84w_15_0"></a><a id="Tc_Mdi8JfG7kEGT1gjtth7yBw_16_0"></a><a id="Tc_kDsq6ML92kyR1z-nx5PEAg_17_0"></a><a id="Tc_OcEj0IaL_kCUU7_SlbuXQg_18_0"></a><a id="Tc_RVVVQKSqkEavmQZqW91IyA_19_0"></a><a id="Tc_Lp-2wJIxBEizjRCo6uhyaw_20_0"></a><a id="Tc_292xc902FEmp5ixtig_MjA_21_0"></a><a id="Tc_iX7hw56tO02R1aEZAGluFw_22_0"></a><a id="Tc_jhOVvpublEiXer1VcfTgwQ_23_0"></a><a id="Tc_khSuoJgFtkeAzN1siLh0VQ_24_0"></a><a id="Tc_ZPSoSWmB7kq314IbBPSa4w_25_0"></a><a id="Tc_TMyNu4t3BkKg8CwfkNqGvw_25_2"></a><a id="_fde4b1f1_7c7c_430d_a0bb_21df184aaf83"></a><a id="Tc_gv1e7r1HwUSDzFZPtkou7w_1_5"></a><a id="Tc_UusbxU3d1k-wFMFo9rMvxg_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_SPu8sGfI00KTkj_sM1VnQA_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_DA-EHc4HmUmlIvbFCxNLcQ_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_9gvczdOpMk6SfTiDihndgw_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_z2DRv04P30GVNOXmTnnWiQ_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_n0JIv1jViEu42F3yEXgSxg_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_ughXylRMEkmqG9_Zyr4uRA_5_5"></a><a id="Tc_oPuWN90iRUWdXSUUZ81sog_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_PC2AT2DZSkmX5_tQWBFVuA_6_2"></a><a id="Tc_0A6sveasrk2sIwZc0taPhg_6_5"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_vTYLq4S28EqUVbxWDc5Lmw_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_vTYLq4S28EqUVbxWDc5Lmw_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">the completion of a thorough analysis to determine the fair value of all assets acquired and liabilities assumed, but in no event later than one year following the completion of the Mergers.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Accordingly, the final acquisition accounting adjustments could differ. The preliminary allocation of the purchase price is as follows: </p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024__Cb2ny4KYUqeIsx0xgHwEg" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfBusinessAcquisitionsByAcquisitionTextBlock" id="Tb_XGg9CO630US4kONIeU-vlA" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:83.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space