ight;margin:0pt;"> (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_1Qgbk7g82EOjEJpYKoWVFQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:BusinessAcquisitionProFormaInterestEarnedOnInvestmentsHeldInTrust" sign="-" scale="0" id="Tc_m7hmDRg-DUeRY4IIENlm2Q_5_6">3,090,086</ix:nonFraction>)</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.62%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.33%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.63%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;"> (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_4ta_xNxfCkqiNHOwOz66pQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:BusinessAcquisitionProFormaInterestEarnedOnInvestmentsHeldInTrust" sign="-" scale="0" id="Tc_LjckWVpGs0eeuwFEesVMzw_5_9">3,087,315</ix:nonFraction>)</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024__Cb2ny4KYUqeIsx0xgHwEg" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionTextBlock" id="Tb_Nm_Eu-YehE2irxs5HoHPFw" continuedAt="Tb_Nm_Eu-YehE2irxs5HoHPFw_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTE 12. ACQUISITION OF THE ASSETS OF ATLASCLEAR, INC</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In connection with the Closing, and pursuant to the terms of the Business Combination Agreement, stockholders of AtlasClear (the &#8220;AtlasClear Stockholders&#8221;) received merger consideration (the &#8220;Merger Consideration Shares&#8221;) consisting of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearIncMember_xi_qPMGjk0mUKdDsEYtZxQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesPurchaseOfAssets" scale="0" id="Narr_uskmYl3fmkWtIZnxRIkM4w">4,440,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock of the Company, par value $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearIncMember_eKJU8KC1rUajEdM2W8Pvdw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_H-_vTQGRtEGx2EL_0jUZjA">0.0001</ix:nonFraction> per share (the &#8220;Common Stock&#8221;). In addition, the AtlasClear Stockholders will receive up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearIncMember_eKJU8KC1rUajEdM2W8Pvdw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:EarnOutSharesMaximumNumberOfSharesIssuable" scale="0" id="Narr_1q16P0CYxEKboAe_xl7WZA">5,944,444</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock (the &#8220;Earn Out Shares&#8221;) upon certain milestones (based on the achievement of certain price targets of Common Stock following the Closing). In the event such milestones are not met within the first <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024__Cb2ny4KYUqeIsx0xgHwEg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:ThresholdPeriodFromClosingToAchieveMilestonesConsideredForIssuanceOfEarnOutShares" id="Narr_73DFTGeKzEyb_SzRZQtuFw">18 months</ix:nonNumeric> following the Closing, the Earn Out Shares will not be issued. Atlas FinTech will also receive up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearIncMember_eKJU8KC1rUajEdM2W8Pvdw" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:EarnOutSharesMaximumAmountOfSharesIssuable" scale="6" id="Narr_rgT2RqpZO0y6TrKq72yqUQ">20</ix:nonFraction> million of shares of Common Stock (&#8220;Software Products Earn Out Shares&#8221;), which will be issued to Atlas FinTech upon certain milestones based on the achievement of certain revenue targets of software products contributed to AtlasClear by Atlas FinTech and Atlas Financial Technologies Corp. following the Closing. The revenue targets will be measured yearly for <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024__Cb2ny4KYUqeIsx0xgHwEg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:PeriodForMeasurementOfRevenueTargets" id="Narr_p7lfe7f-8Eao8axI7ErvUQ">five years</ix:nonNumeric> following Closing, with no catch-up between the years.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-25</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);min-height:11.5pt;"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><a id="_478f547f_a3ff_46b8_84ac_460e3a4b5ed4"></a><a id="Tc_dDiHzmNFQE2ddosNKa_YHw_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_CwL2Cpg2HkqE4Giyn2gXcQ_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_Gqb2_MwpuUmfM_yhUumOaQ_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_DTWLmIR6W0OolC13rdCjhQ_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_aKWl9jwtqEmH90w9u_dy5g_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_oY435D_W1U-RE9YGjXWnSQ_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_faSoECCXjEG5U-QgK5iPRA_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_i585agrd80Wsm4GuTOUBjQ_5_2"></a><a id="Tc_IEHDFMMwuEqub3rVzzo9mw_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_ibXr5lf-2kynR-FcDRVPVg_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_9wKHt-RBOUeKfDgyQK6XLw_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_egH9_Q82xEqIU7KSFh54Ng_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_ss22ZIBlgE-l9uTKaD2elQ_9_2"></a><a id="Tc_2vRHysX6sEyNx-d6jmJpoQ_10_0"></a><a id="Tc__u7J5En_d0eiJn-Jc2U8Mw_10_2"></a><a id="Tc_Ydrabjm_KUql5U0hiC1sBA_12_0"></a><a id="Tc_QKZnCfmY6Ui5ORR59J6YHg_12_2"></a><a id="Tc_FxxgmA1_PECE2t2kQSf0uA_13_0"></a><a id="Tc_T-qO24rFHUW5IR0h1TT2jA_14_0"></a><a id="Tc_RHDqEg8vWkOvv4t9-GeWjA_15_0"></a><a id="Tc_TbEX_uM-vUmW36xXlSy_KA_15_2"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_Nm_Eu-YehE2irxs5HoHPFw_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">To reflect the purchase of Developed Technology identified under the Assignment and Assumption Agreement and Bill of Sale (the &#8220;Contribution Agreement&#8221;) between AtlasClear, Atlas FinTech and Atlas Financial Technologies Corp., pursuant to which Atlas FinTech and Atlas Financial Technologies Corp. contributed to AtlasClear all rights, title and interest in certain intellectual property, among other things. There are no historical revenues for the Developed Technology and AtlasClear&#8217;s management determined the fair value based on their experience and expectations from running similar models in previous companies. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024__Cb2ny4KYUqeIsx0xgHwEg" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionTableTextBlock" id="Group_WZR69dm_mUKDa2rDD82AdQ" continuedAt="Group_WZR69dm_mUKDa2rDD82AdQ_2" escape="true">The value was derived based on the purchase price allocation as follows: (the table below is expressed in thousands)</ix:nonNumeric></p><ix:continuation id="Group_WZR69dm_mUKDa2rDD82AdQ_2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:83.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.63%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:no