" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" sign="-" scale="0" id="Tc_FeHpt8xzEEymn1xJxfo9Zg_13_3">317,231</ix:nonFraction>)</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:83.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-left:7.2pt;text-indent:-7.2pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">Carrying balance of Technology acquired written off</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.63%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.65%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:12.36%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearIncMember_xi_qPMGjk0mUKdDsEYtZxQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:CarryingBalanceOfTechnologyAcquiredWrittenOff" scale="0" id="Tc_o_aYLdW3AEy5hXt1U_yxZQ_14_3">17,845,813</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:83.34%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-left:7.2pt;text-indent:-7.2pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">Total loss on AtlasClear technology acquired</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.63%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.65%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:12.36%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearIncMember_xi_qPMGjk0mUKdDsEYtZxQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionLossOnTransaction" scale="0" id="Tc_aWlxdQXPskSxZpkab5K1aw_15_3">86,392,769</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table><div style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10.0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;min-height:1.19em;position:relative;width:100%;"><div style="background-color:#000000;height:1pt;position:relative;top:0.6em;width:25.0%;border:none;margin:0 auto 0 0;"></div></div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">(a)</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">The closing consideration of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearIncMember_xi_qPMGjk0mUKdDsEYtZxQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestIssuedAndIssuable" scale="6" id="Narr_ZbQWUJe1JkKcYWETw8yrBA">44.40</ix:nonFraction> million is to be delivered in common stock. As such <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024__Cb2ny4KYUqeIsx0xgHwEg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesPurchaseOfAssets" scale="0" id="Narr_K0mJ5kjDSkC64qQImkr-RA">4,400,000</ix:nonFraction> were delivered based on $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_i2gUnkY77UuxcoehQ3RXew" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_bEATXCgEHEWuQTNHH0LzAg">10</ix:nonFraction> per share presumed value of common stock.</p></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">(b)</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">Atlas FinTech will receive up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_b3eSpSkzKUuxNbsSKQlMLQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:EarnOutSharesMaximumAmountOfSharesIssuable" scale="6" id="Narr_oZZv6Yh_ekiyjInotZsa_w">20.00</ix:nonFraction> million of Common Stock (&#8220;Software Products Earn Out Shares&#8221;), which will be issued to Atlas FinTech upon certain milestones (based on the achievement of certain revenue targets of software products contributed to AtlasClear by Atlas FinTech and Atlas Financial Technologies Corp. following the Closing). The revenue targets will be measured yearly for the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_n34UoIJUAkCZzo0QXmrPYw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:PeriodForMeasurementOfRevenueTargets" id="Narr_LKBYkuEJo0Kg0PrHHMlzxA">five years</ix:nonNumeric> following Closing, with no catch-up between the years. The value was determined based on projected revenue based on a discount factor. The Earn Out provision was analyzed under ASC 480 and ASC 815. the Software Products Earn Out Shares Payments in this transaction are within the scope of ASC 480 and therefore will be accounted for as a liability and included in the purchase price consideration. The revenue earnout was estimated using a Monte Carlo simulation to determine if and when the revenue hurdles would be achieved. The revenue volatility and revenue to equity correlation was based upon the same guideline public companies. The Monte Carlo simulation was performed simultaneously on both the share price and revenue to account for the correlation between revenue and equity.</p></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">(c)</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">Atlas FinTech will receive up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_b3eSpSkzKUuxNbsSKQlMLQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:EarnOutSharesMaximumNumberOfSharesIssuable" scale="0" id="Narr_D-HSh8BAskSX3PLToqpoIA">5,944,444</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock (the &#8220;Earn Out Shares&#8221;). The Earn Out Shares will be issued to AtlasClear Stockholders upon certain milestones (based on the achievement of certain price targets of Common Stock following the Closing). In the event such milestones are not met within the first <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_n34UoIJUAkCZzo0QXmrPYw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:ThresholdPeriodFromClosingToAchieveMilestonesConsideredForIssuanceOfEarnOutShares" id="Narr_GinSA6XZWEu5pqWV4KXpBg">18 months</ix:nonNumeric> following the Closing, the Earn Out Shares will be cancelled. The Earn Out provision was analyzed under ASC 480 and ASC 815. The earnout provision was deemed to be indexed to the Company&#8217;s own stock and therefore equity classified. The share based earnout was estimated using a Monte Carlo simulation to determine if and when the stock price hurdles would be achieved. The expected stock price volatility was based upon guideline public companies.</p></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">(d)</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">Under SAB topic 5G transfers of nonmonetary assets for stock prior to an initial offering should be recorded at predecessor cost in accordance with GAAP. As such the value of the Developed Technology was based on the carrying value of Atlas FinTech of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_n34UoIJUAkCZzo0QXmrPYw" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FinitelivedIntangibleAssetsAcquired1" scale="6" id="Narr_1nB8I5qzyUmG8B9GonUFLg">18.16</ix:nonFraction> million. The estimated useful life was determined to be <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_n34UoIJUAkCZzo0QXmrPYw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife" id="Narr_7Kgytf-IlEqzO-BBRsRUsg">eight years</ix:nonNumeric>. There are no historical revenues for the Developed Technology and AtlasClear&#8217;s management determined the fair value based on their experience and expectations from running similar models in previous companies.</p></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">(e)</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">ASC 350 prohibits the recognition of goodwill in an asset purchase. As such the difference between the purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_n34UoIJUAkCZzo0QXmrPYw" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:PurchasePriceForAssetsTransfer" scale="6" id="Narr_D5CP0g1veEGJl7ix0hZZJQ">86.98</ix:nonFraction> million was charged as transactions and recorded under accumulated deficit of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_n34UoIJUAkCZzo0QXmrPYw" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferredTransactionCost" scale="6" id="Narr_y_Gt6xnHjkGCv2NP3-MIyw">68.55</ix:nonFraction> million.</p></td></tr></table></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Pursuant to the Contribution Agreement, Atlas FinTech and Atlas Financial Technologies Corp. contributed to AtlasClear all their rights, title and interest to the above stated software products and intellectual property assets upon the closing of the Business Combination (the &#8220;FinTech Assets&#8221;). At present, none of the FinTech assets are in production. Further, due to limited capital contributions from the Quantum&#8217;s trust account, management views timelines for revenue recognition from the FinTech Assets to be unknowable and therefore has decided to write down the assets.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-26</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><a id="Tc_nye5wXxFeESLk9adMrBsdw_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_7oL2cT_5IU-RhzbWfLKCBA_2_7"></a><a id="Tc_S4ytJ21_y0GWB3WeAYPd8A_2_10"></a><a id="Tc_5_fA830SdE6Vr1HopsHBIw_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_PyvGYFEWfE-wUBLRzxZb1g_3_4"></a><a id="Tc__oA5tMBthU2wqqWVsBzofQ_3_7"></a><a id="Tc_xO7PjewY_UG8hLGBVV0HSQ_3_10"></a><a id="Tc_6MwoHCe2j0OWqv5RYU-qhw_3_13"></a><a id="Tc_C0Vo0tP3P0KcljIqPNG_Og_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_lpeJ4BJbjEO7PWRJ-Yt1gQ_5_2"></a><a id="Tc_e1Ve1p6SF0W3sr0drK-eag_5_4"></a><a id="Tc_iCFsjJWHwUWDAt7HywCbKg_5_7"></a><a id="Tc_rFfU-mjE4ku5AQe7-xDxOA_5_8"></a><a id="Tc_-Q6yMcsHM022fxXD5YUOYg_5_10"></a><a id="Tc_bYRoKpsnPkyHDtdiTi33Sg_5_11"></a><a id="Tc_Qnf0em5ooU-4zD7_hupJog_5_13"></a><a id="Tc_7-YeIaqWeUSGocsNBzsecQ_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_wbNjfEgenUiMHJqa4jCIyw_6_8"></a><a id="Tc_ayqIcphGMUW9G-NkJfgD7Q_6_11"></a><a id="Tc_k7Y65rMonUegS3clcEAeRw_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_-4YCOL0wUkyRRNroieOEig_7_14"></a><a id="Tc_sCmZGPjuekmxrgepHVbl3w_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_GUhpBF49i0G06t1AY27paw_8_11"></a><a id="Tc_l02UvvC8Nka3_QLJ36puVQ_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_rHAdoJj-ykijGzmhgLoHJQ_9_4"></a><a id="Tc_PXP7oM4eSke-cBLTso7UyA_9_7"></a><a id="Tc_se5LYMU4RkuAvym8qnu8EA_9_10"></a><a id="Tc_7Q5QCl2qvky1_4F_7l1qCA_9_13"></a><a id="Tc_thOC32nPkUyGNxFD6taWZA_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_3-YY-pESbkGc_5nMC-Wq8Q_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_EZzIeFy9X0GKeKCXDz0nuw_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_DrIRJ-Sg8kCqGAHL6_WmFQ_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_6Pg1Me7YO0qWGcLUhKi7QQ_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_svnKfTDd7ECmJEskl4Hn3g_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_JQKZmwgQnUuj2BU9Q-YW8Q_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_7cnEJ4-t_UO8mZ3Lz9I9Ng_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_kXv0wPYlwEaI2BBcdSZltQ_7_0"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024__Cb2ny4KYUqeIsx0xgHwEg" name="us-gaap:IntangibleAssetsDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_3Mm81RGYK0y-iT5BlB80kw" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTE 13. INTANGIBLE ASSETS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Pacsquare Purchase Agreement</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Pursuant to the transactions contemplated by a letter of intent, on February 16, 2024, AtlasClear and Pacsquare entered into a Source Code Purchase Agreement and Master Services Agreement (the &#8220;Pacsquare Purchase Agreement&#8221;), pursuant to which AtlasClear acquired the AtlasClear Platform. Pursuant to the Pacsquare Purchase Agreement, Pacsquare will develop, implement and launch the AtlasClear Platform and provide maintenance and support services as described in the agreement. The Pacsquare Purchase Agreement provides that Pacsquare will develop and deliver to AtlasClear the Level 1 equities trading platform and that it will develop and deliver all modules of the clearing platform within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_JmiDY_QWIUOA1rB3NPGIIA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:ThresholdPeriodToReceiveLevel1EquitiesTradingPlatformFromSigningOfAgreement" id="Narr_Y4AuZ1S-kEiW1pM1qQIEmg">12 months</ix:nonNumeric> of signing the Pacsquare Purchase Agreement. AtlasClear owns all the intellectual property relating to the AtlasClear Platform, including the software and source code. The Pacsquare Purchase Agreement also granted AtlasClear a right of first refusal to any products or services that relate to trading, settlement, clearance or any other business of AtlasClear that Pacsquare proposes to offer to other persons. The purchase price for the assets was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_JmiDY_QWIUOA1rB3NPGIIA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionPriceOfAcquisitionExpected" scale="6" id="Narr_XC_ufK9vLka6y2K3xxPBtw">4.8</ix:nonFraction> million as follows: (i) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_5jVCFWgfjEKQsY_ZBIY1Vw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionPurchaseConsiderationPayableInCashAndSharesOfCommonStock" scale="6" id="Narr_nVqWpUpx7kCn-x9hRNV6XA">1.9</ix:nonFraction> million, consisting of (A) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_5jVCFWgfjEKQsY_ZBIY1Vw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionPurchaseConsiderationPayableInCashUponDeliveryOfSourceCodeAndExecutionOfPurchaseAgreement" scale="0" id="Narr_tvFYbfh84EKEwizBjdYKvw">100,000</ix:nonFraction> payable in a cash upon delivery of the source code and execution of the Pacsquare Purchase Agreement; (B) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_JmiDY_QWIUOA1rB3NPGIIA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestIssuedAndIssuable" scale="0" id="Narr_Mnp5etFCZEyzaDPDvFYbRg">850,000</ix:nonFraction> payable in shares of Common Stock at a price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_5jVCFWgfjEKQsY_ZBIY1Vw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_U55Pq6SA-EuzLGaYbHt6aQ">6.00</ix:nonFraction> per share; and (C) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_5jVCFWgfjEKQsY_ZBIY1Vw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionPurchaseConsiderationPayableInFourMonthlyInstallments" scale="0" id="Narr_wzrbwUmEC0m9l85jMr-TRw">950,000</ix:nonFraction> to be paid in <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_installment_naZ3LCjrPUCQHLaJ5sTEcg" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_5jVCFWgfjEKQsY_ZBIY1Vw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionPurchaseConsiderationNumberOfMonthlyInstallments" scale="0" id="Narr_4b8B3gWgEE6vb-0bGlhfiw">four</ix:nonFraction> monthly installments of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_5jVCFWgfjEKQsY_ZBIY1Vw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionPurchaseConsiderationPayableInEachMonthlyInstallment" scale="0" id="Narr_-PpejN21zE2CUlxrRUlUXQ">237,500</ix:nonFraction>, payable in shares of Common Stock at the price per share on the day of issuance and (ii) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_5jVCFWgfjEKQsY_ZBIY1Vw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionPurchaseConsiderationPayableRatablyOnModuleByModuleBasisUponDeliveryAndAcceptanceOfEachOfPlatformModules" scale="6" id="Narr_uCglDvjHSUGGDZDv_BCzUA">2.7</ix:nonFraction> million to be paid ratably on a module-by-module basis upon delivery and acceptance of each of the AtlasClear Platform modules. AtlasClear has sole discretion to determine whether any of the foregoing payments will be made in cash or shares of Common Stock. As of June 30, 2024, the Company has issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_5jVCFWgfjEKQsY_ZBIY1Vw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_vCpDXIb4AkqLDdcbyhWrOA">336,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_atch_PurchasePricePerShareAt600Member_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_tknK6K3ZuEiqfuNqIKIWeA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_Wg5PlfArOES0V27_vd0UDg">141,667</ix:nonFraction> valued at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_atch_PurchasePricePerShareAt600Member_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_tknK6K3ZuEiqfuNqIKIWeA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_LnuOEmzrWE-tBkhRieyxCw">6</ix:nonFraction> per share as per agreed upon terms and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_atch_PurchasePricePerShareAt150Member_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_6jWlhpo2e0yK5EGcXNqnxw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_yTp_aO_Fl067CLFDOVZzYA">194,333</ix:nonFraction> valued at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_atch_PurchasePricePerShareAt150Member_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_6jWlhpo2e0yK5EGcXNqnxw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_NuEJJf2hi06LWJoJV6b84g">1.50</ix:nonFraction> per share based on the fair value of common stock on March 12, 2024 date share were issued to Pacsquare pursuant to the terms of the Pacsquare Purchase Agreement and paid $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_JmiDY_QWIUOA1rB3NPGIIA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireProductiveAssets" scale="0" id="Narr_WMzLN8GPYkOfn1QISdLsKQ">500,000</ix:nonFraction> in cash and accrued $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_i2gUnkY77UuxcoehQ3RXew" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionAccruedInAccountsPayable" scale="0" id="Narr_tWWi9rpea0eI1JpI3gnB_A">85,000</ix:nonFraction> in accounts payable for total carrying value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_JmiDY_QWIUOA1rB3NPGIIA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_c93SAA98lkGBRWWsh2zFTg">1,726,500</ix:nonFraction>. The AtlasClear platform is not yet in use as such amortization has not yet commenced.<br/><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Intangible Assets of the company at June 30, 2024 are summarized as follows:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024__Cb2ny4KYUqeIsx0xgHwEg" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfIndefiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsTableTextBlock" id="Tb_Hk30lyC_IEWI6qjeRYzUMg" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:33.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:1.8%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden