r></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-41</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><a id="Narr_inv_WhBC0UepdwwmGHvBjw"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024__Cb2ny4KYUqeIsx0xgHwEg" name="us-gaap:SubsequentEventsTextBlock" id="Tb_QRgypDPYfEGYRNnVmXss5g" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTE&#160;21. SUBSEQUENT EVENTS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The Company evaluated subsequent events and transactions that occurred after the balance sheet date up to the date that the consolidated financial statements were issued. Based upon this review, other than described below, the Company did not identify any subsequent events that would have required adjustment or disclosure in the consolidated financial statements, other than as described below.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On July 5, 2024 pursuant to the transactions contemplated by a letter of intent, between AtlasClear and Pacsquare for the Source Code Purchase Agreement and Master Services Agreement, the Company issued and additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_5_2024_To_7_5_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_D_vr_dImGUWJiZ17-zxIdA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesAcquisitions" scale="0" id="Narr_iGYfrP3p306C7ZxBh_JSHg">500,000</ix:nonFraction> shares to Pacsquare.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In accordance with the Chardan Convertible Note agreement, the note holder converted $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_carDQo9YbUyeSvLp7LhP_g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_JCfVg8aHYkyQcGt4HbgmVw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_uHxFLa0780-FLHiuhZmkTA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_KaX3P7Ij1E21J255wuJTAQ">725,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> in principle and received <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_carDQo9YbUyeSvLp7LhP_g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" id="Narr_18XUYdqcI0Kh5Nhf_EH73Q"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_uHxFLa0780-FLHiuhZmkTA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" id="Narr_lkHe9UPSQ0y6QUbaY8yilQ">2,263,031</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> shares on various dates subsequent to June 30, 2024, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_vM72OFx1oUi7OH9oZDSgAQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_Oqcc6aTTTU2jswKuG-5LdQ">493,909</ix:nonFraction> of the shares were transferred by Atlas Fintech, Co-Sponsor. In addition, interest for the quarter ended March 31, 2024 and June 30, 2024 was paid with shares transferred by a Atlas Fintech on behalf of the Company for a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_iujX6XALw0-WjPmJvzqqKQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_Fw7eKT3s1E21F5dsUk2xvA">198,196</ix:nonFraction> shares.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Subsequent to June 30, 2024, Quantum Venture, Co-Sponsor and Atlas Fintech, Co-Sponsor transferred <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_6_30_2024_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_QuantumVenturesLLCMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_SellerNotesMember_3phwq4mIPkO8BfcjxjhYHg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_Sjl8Vtt8wkq1NQN6EHGGng">1,558,923</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_6_30_2024_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_SellerNotesMember_4u_dcyuVjkK1uGgRNGUXng" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_omMMTsEe0EuGISdcEkVB_w">1,183,629</ix:nonFraction> shares respectively as payment of interest under various Note obligations such as the Promissory notes, Secured Convertible notes and the Short and long term notes due to sellers.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On July 31, 2024, the Company and Tau entered into the ELOC Agreement. Pursuant to the ELOC Agreement, upon the terms thereof and subject to the satisfaction of certain conditions, the Company has the right from time to time at the Company&#8217;s option to direct Tau to purchase up to a specified maximum amount of shares of our Common Stock, up to a maximum aggregate purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_s8eYqrjyLUaF_pCjgh3ZaQ" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:MaximumAggregatePurchasePrice" scale="6" id="Narr_OL4bnKc32kOHSKCOemz6zg">10</ix:nonFraction> million (the &#8220;Aggregate Limit&#8221;), over the <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_V8UsGQfRt06gIRw8pxS-Lg;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">24-month</span></span> term of the ELOC Agreement. The Company may request, individual advances up to the greater of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_s8eYqrjyLUaF_pCjgh3ZaQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ThresholdSharesOfIndividualAdvancesThatCanBeRequested" scale="0" id="Narr_B0twZuBjSE2-ggB4yTqZfw">100,000</ix:nonFraction> shares or such amount as is equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_7_31_2024_To_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_MaA0Tb5gAk2fbfUtJEUXUg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:IndividualAdvancesRequestedPercentageOfAverageDailyVolumeOfCommonStockTraded" scale="-2" id="Narr_73Ytbuw6AkS0R8FOe9trWA">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the average daily volume traded of the Common Stock during the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_LQ4M5hqi1EqO2C4N7zkpIw" contextRef="Duration_7_31_2024_To_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_MaA0Tb5gAk2fbfUtJEUXUg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:IndividualAdvancesRequestedThresholdTradingDays" scale="0" id="Narr__SWV1PvfDECGxKsmBhU16A">30</ix:nonFraction> trading days immediately prior to the date the request of each advance, subject to the Aggregate Limit. Any such advance will reduce amounts that the Company can request for future advances and draw downs. The purchase price payable for the shares sold pursuant to any advance will be equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_7_31_2024_To_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_MaA0Tb5gAk2fbfUtJEUXUg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:SharesSoldPurchasePricePayableAsPercentageOfLowestVolumeWeightedAveragePriceOfCommonStock" scale="-2" id="Narr_pLiJivlhzEahte3RdVke2A">97</ix:nonFraction>% of the lowest VWAP of the Common Stock during a pricing period of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_LQ4M5hqi1EqO2C4N7zkpIw" contextRef="Duration_7_31_2024_To_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_MaA0Tb5gAk2fbfUtJEUXUg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:IndividualAdvancesRequestedThresholdConsecutiveTradingDays" scale="0" id="Narr_pcFkIaDjBkuKiS-HPbUy7Q">three</ix:nonFraction> consecutive trading days following Tau&#8217;s receipt of the applicable advance notice. Tau&#8217;s obligation to purchase the shares the Company request to sell pursuant to any advance is conditioned upon, in addition to certain other customary closing conditions, the continued effectiveness of a registration statement pursuant to which Tau may freely sell the shares to be received. <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_s8eYqrjyLUaF_pCjgh3ZaQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_3T6jXjOJjEy4a4fb5Srq2A">10,000,000</ix:nonFraction> of the shares of Common Stock that may be issuable to Tau pursuant to the ELOC Agreement are being registered hereby. Tau is an underwriter within the meaning of Section 2(a)(11) of the Securities Act. The registration of the shares hereunder does not mean that Tau will actually purchase or that the Company will actually issue and sell all or any of the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_s8eYqrjyLUaF_pCjgh3ZaQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_h8-QLc8mw0aa14e8mORR3A">10,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of our Common Stock being registered for potential issuance to Tau pursuant to this registration statement. The Company has issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_31_2024_To_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_MaA0Tb5gAk2fbfUtJEUXUg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr__XBSCzViW0GS7jDqKw6pfQ">2,475,000</ix:nonFraction> shares under the ELOC.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On August 9, 2024, the Company entered into a Satisfaction of Discharge of indebtedness agreement with Atlas Fintech Holdings Corporation. In the agreement the Company agreed to issue <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_8_9_2024_To_8_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_qUOo7mwVeE2ZITClmcqv3Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_yRM8BC02a06eczSzxdVauQ">2,788,276</ix:nonFraction> shares in satisfaction of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_8_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_kiAnsm5DEUq0U1bZXKJcRw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockValue" scale="0" id="Narr_ynhjAGJ4jUepLv9ZyQ0Jcw">803,860</ix:nonFraction> included in accounts payable. In addition the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_8_9_2024_To_8_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_qUOo7mwVeE2ZITClmcqv3Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ReimbursementSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_A5PiS56xJECEBj4k2p_Gfw">1,337,500</ix:nonFraction> shares as reimbursement for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_8_9_2024_To_8_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_qUOo7mwVeE2ZITClmcqv3Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AdditionalSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_A-jcybz5jkWiYhMBvaTS4A">1,183,629</ix:nonFraction> shares that were transferred by Atlas Fintech Holdings Corporation to satisfy the Company requirements to pay interest on various loans with unrestricted shares. The company agreed to compensate the Atlas Fintech Holding Corporation <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_8_9_2024_To_8_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_qUOo7mwVeE2ZITClmcqv3Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:PercentageOfCompensationFeeAgreed" scale="0" id="Narr_9JoYaTQPZ0CpznVvAhQ7aQ">13</ix:nonFraction>% fee. As such a total of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_Wo3Dk5jS70KJj0nqlUkGsQ;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">4,125,776</span></span> Common Stock shares were transferred.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On August 28, 2024, the Company issued an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_8_28_2024_To_8_28_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_atch_WilsonDavisMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_0cNi3Ri1OEeYMC06O_L9BQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesAcquisitions" scale="0" id="Narr_rLf6Y960FEaNrAm0LyokLg">1,055,448</ix:nonFraction> shares to the Wilson-Davis selling shareholders as payment of interest under the short term and long term note and as consideration for the Merger Consideration paid in stock.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On August 29, 2024, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_8_29_2024_To_8_29_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_LeadNectarMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_GRfj7wM_okqsVbRfI91UEw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_bKcrDaifr0eHXQiFCzDAQQ">12,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock to Lead Nectar in lieu of payment for internet marketing services in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_8_29_2024_To_8_29_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_LeadNectarMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_GRfj7wM_okqsVbRfI91UEw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_OLEG5INR4UqyzUm81GfdGg">20,000</ix:nonFraction>, at a price per share of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_8_29_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_LeadNectarMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_fp8vCvGliUGYc0WP_llEAQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_Bj2GToOzu0ueS1IEH0Knhg">1.66</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On July 10, 2024 and August 29, 2024, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_10_2024_To_7_10_2024_9FRETRF5nEavzvgAqsuK8g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_Bm7cwZZuR0a55xT2l0b6VA">1,602,994</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_8_29_2024_To_8_29_2024_LtQKMjEl10qLSHnnuPcf2A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_8Bzs5SqnJk-XyKaS0i6OTA">882,668</ix:nonFraction> shares, respectively as partial conversion and payments of interest on the Short- and Long term Sellers Notes, the July distribution included share transfer from counders to cover the contingent guarantee made to the sellets.<br/><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Prior to the maturity date of October 13, 2024, FINRA approved a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_10_13_2024_To_10_13_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_s_poJjRcgkqUtQeWlD8Qyg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:SubordinatedNotesExtensionTerm" id="Narr_bEmaj9BNBUCsdkv0kBmOjw">one-year</ix:nonNumeric> extension for $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_10_13_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_QHYgwOY91kC9CM7Yax9inQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:JuniorSubordinatedNotes" scale="0" id="Narr_fgqn6XcifkSlXdTvHUYyNw">1,280,000</ix:nonFraction> in Subordinated notes. The interest rate on the subordinated notes increased from <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_10_12_2024_To_10_12_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_J0odwRwqx0KWae-f-QHYrg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SubordinatedBorrowingInterestRate" scale="-2" id="Narr__NNRVUJ8XkiHgiulZi2zXw">5</ix:nonFraction>% to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_10_13_2024_To_10_13_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_s_poJjRcgkqUtQeWlD8Qyg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SubordinatedBorrowingInterestRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_9zE44pxUr0a6lJVoHRSnrw">8</ix:nonFraction>% and the notes mature on October 13, 2025. One of the notes, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_10_13_2024_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_QHYgwOY91kC9CM7Yax9inQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ValueOfSubordinatedNotesNotRenewed" scale="0" id="Narr_HRtzrthn302bpvNha7Euzg">20,000</ix:nonFraction>, was not renewed and will not be included in the Net Capital calculations. The note will be treated as debt.</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="display:none;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';line-height:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-42</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><a id="_9fd574ab_ad9e_4599_8b1b_3520fee20587"></a><a id="PARTIFINANCIALINFORMATION_35281"></a><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">ATLASCLEAR HOLDINGS, INC.</b></p><a id="CONDENSEDCONSOLIDATEDBALANCESHEETS_87480"></a><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED BALANCE SHEETS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="_35790df4_ed1f_4406_b41a_89b0f58ea619"></a><a id="Tc_fENIuqs5D0uQT9gUR7JM5Q_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_c3ea_gZ2nkqBw4Ri4IgIDQ_1_5"></a><a id="Tc_NBgnn_XR5Uq6Zu1Gb4xkMw_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_7qNZy5fqFk6sDoKzBSUc3Q_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_X5ocX_ei8keC1Va1bluENg_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_iZTdHnvSME6qka8gEi4s1A_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_F5jiMtUA9kikhYr1w8aK_Q_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_tX2eMCq-30KPcGfTnFfqVw_5_2"></a><a id="Tc_D3RMHQLz1U-lHBw4RPd0Ow_5_5"></a><a id="Tc_AWBSszlFqUWz40jbO0zIfQ_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_JIYNYQqy80iCXw2kFgRyug_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_-64UxMPq80y2D8qKPpchkg_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_3Yq7xgdmTkGMMRHpCzEy9Q_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_4kU07CY980SfcgocERPI-Q_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_aVGEAbxMSkquYW70QrK_