mes New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-left:7.2pt;text-indent:-7.2pt;margin:0pt;">Less: Accumulated depreciation and Amortization</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.58%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.64%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:14.03%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;"> (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_ll4s9jxr1U6ujm8UtL-j9w" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AccumulatedDepreciationDepletionAndAmortizationPropertyPlantAndEquipment" scale="0" id="Tc_xO-luBvWi0CUUFot92HYLA_7_3">364,537</ix:nonFraction>)</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:81.73%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.58%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.64%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:14.03%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_ll4s9jxr1U6ujm8UtL-j9w" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentNet" scale="0" id="Tc_kccVJ37gAEKablVbLpI3xw_8_3">11,511</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="_d484c60f_0724_4475_888c_84f57835ad33"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionsDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_2AfIeWN-oka4s8y9-JkNaQ" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTE&#160;8. RELATED PARTY TRANSACTIONS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Related Party Share Issuance/Transfers</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Quantum Ventures LLC (&#8220;Quantum Ventures&#8221; or the &#8220;Sponsor&#8221;) and AtlasFinTech transferred <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_QuantumVenturesLLCMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_SellerNotesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_atch_SponsorMember_jYHyYVS5jEah46RuGsEQIg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_dD-SWUBWsEuIDtOOIVMQ9A">1,558,923</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_SellerNotesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_atch_SponsorMember_orU7uTN9X0W1PalwoOEa2g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_wMiS1fZyL0KzQeAa2tu15A">991,665</ix:nonFraction> shares, respectively for total contributed shares of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_YDIT0rCwA0a9FVZFQYYKwA">2,550,588</ix:nonFraction> shares recorded as contributed capital for $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentValueTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_tUNEP7mcQEautyC9x8-6OQ">2,412,930</ix:nonFraction>. The Company recorded contributed capital for the value of the liabilities settled with their personal shareholding. The contributed capital recognized was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember_DOphI8FBdkyOrz9FERqvfQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:StockIssuedToPayInterestOnSecurities" sign="-" scale="0" id="Narr_f0TJk_4h6EKHQuz5wBWiSA">21,299</ix:nonFraction> in interest paid in shares for Promissory Notes, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_SecuredDebtMember_FWGuZakEBUKe627gN4Gf5g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:StockIssuedToPayInterestOnSecurities" sign="-" scale="0" id="Narr_6TtKoE5GpkG00CL1xwYnWw">217,397</ix:nonFraction> in interest paid in shares for Secured Convertible Note, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_vyGADshG0UC5dW3Vy8zLhw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionOriginalDebtPrincipalAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_NW9_tjYA1kO9LoPb-0Oexg">400,000</ix:nonFraction> of Principal converted under the Chardan convertible note along with $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_vyGADshG0UC5dW3Vy8zLhw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:StockIssuedToPayInterestOnSecurities" sign="-" scale="0" id="Narr_9HtUIexQ4ki3bP5CosudYg">212,803</ix:nonFraction> in interest paid in shares for the Chardan convertible note, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortAndLongTermNotesMember_gn24sQLOTEOToKzyqftRHQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:StockIssuedToPayInterestOnSecurities" sign="-" scale="0" id="Narr_hCB4smd6B0CHfbJdT_E1aw">351,141</ix:nonFraction> in interest paid in shares for Short and long term Notes and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:StockIssuedPaymentTowardsContingentGuarantee" scale="0" id="Narr_BG8UwvcY3kiHusbtvQa-sw">1,210,290</ix:nonFraction> for payment in shares under the contingent obligation to sellers.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On August 9, 2024, the Company entered into a Satisfaction of Discharge of indebtedness agreement with Atlas FinTech. Pursuant to the agreement the Company issued&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_8_9_2024_To_8_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_91Gh0Y-yVEOCgyieG4pYog" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" id="Narr_pqlaGEmzy0eRTg9cN8WQPg">2,788,276</ix:nonFraction> shares in satisfaction of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_8_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_99TIr9Kkn0aSbDiBOKVtrg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockValue" scale="0" id="Narr_7-2U82QDP0-87q1mbEqbow">803,860</ix:nonFraction> included in accounts payable. In addition, the Company issued&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_8_9_2024_To_8_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_91Gh0Y-yVEOCgyieG4pYog" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ReimbursementSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_dAoEixngxEmS_N_ZkF0zkg">1,337,500</ix:nonFraction> shares as reimbursement for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_8_9_2024_To_8_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_91Gh0Y-yVEOCgyieG4pYog" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AdditionalSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_qu-i1LGGfUWXKQ5B75G4_w">991,665</ix:nonFraction> shares that were transferred by AtlasFinTech, as stated above, to satisfy the Company requirements to pay interest on various loans with unrestricted shares. As such a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_8_9_2024_To_8_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_91Gh0Y-yVEOCgyieG4pYog" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_Bu0y_8GJDkOl238zS9Fg_Q">4,125,776</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock of the Company, par value $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_8_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_99TIr9Kkn0aSbDiBOKVtrg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_rpQ-T8YO0kmKIwkCWF-xCg">0.0001</ix:nonFraction> per share (the &#8220;Common Stock&#8221;) were transferred to Atlas FinTech in satisfaction.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Advances from Related Parties</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Atlas FinTech, a related party and shareholder, incurred expenditures of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_6_30_2024_To_6_30_2024_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_AtlasfintechHoldingsCorpMember_wQuRWpdiE0-yzXx0CthNZQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationAcquisitionRelatedCosts" scale="0" id="Narr_HL82mDEXBEuGFWXKBdOEAQ">803,860</ix:nonFraction> in connection with the business combination. The amount is included in account payable and accrued liabilities as of June 30, 2024. On August 9, 2024 the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_8_9_2024_To_8_9_2024_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_AtlasfintechHoldingsCorpMember_o5whOJWEikew8xbPi-dEPQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesSettlementOfDues" scale="0" id="Narr_PBTPoUUXhUy9Uq47lOYLdA">2,788,276</ix:nonFraction> shares to Atlas FinTech as full settlement of this payable as described above.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On May 9, 2024, Quantum Ventures, a related party transferred <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_5_9_2024_To_5_9_2024_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_QuantumVenturesLlcMember_3bID8eAhE02JKRnAs-35XQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" id="Narr_6ob2CBuf3keLh3trIUs04g">56,073</ix:nonFraction> shares to pay for the $47,750 of interest in connection with the short term sellers notes. The shares are to be reissued at a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_5_9_2024_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_QuantumVenturesLlcMember_7r5jjFU_SEC2ecEhUT5QWw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_pcbpzHlAm0WXtA7h1AlxpQ">13</ix:nonFraction>% interest rate, as such a payable of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_5_9_2024_To_5_9_2024_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_QuantumVenturesLlcMember_3bID8eAhE02JKRnAs-35XQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentIncreaseAccruedInterest" scale="0" id="Narr_x0FZHkuFH0eNlIhjaU0TFw">55,087</ix:nonFraction> was accrued.</p></ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" name="atch:NotesPayableAndCommitmentsAndContingenciesDisclosureTextBlockTextblock" id="Tb_UGS0MvoYo0S4dGSQZp8EBw" continuedAt="Tb_UGS0MvoYo0S4dGSQZp8EBw_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTE&#160;9.</b><b style="font-weight:bold;"> </b><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES PAYABLE AND COMMITMENTS AND CONTINGENCIES</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Registration Rights</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company filed a registration statement on Form S-1 to register the resale of up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_5_14_2024_SThzlA3CYkmiQuTMp-1h2w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:SharesAuthorizedForResaleBySellingStockholders" scale="0" id="Narr_iiV43aZYQkmxwJ0gqk9ilA">77,577,099</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock by the selling stockholders named in the registration statement, which became effective on August 14, 2024. The Company will not receive any of the proceeds from these sales.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Business Combination Marketing Agreement</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">In connection with the Closing on February 9, 2024, the Company and Chardan agreed that the fee, in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_fGwcjU1I102YJQ8732FGSg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:MarketingFeesPayableToUnderwritersWaivedInExchangeForNotesPayable" scale="0" id="Narr_tfo7RnHu2kOMBeGyXOezfA">7,043,750</ix:nonFraction>, payable by the Company to Chardan upon the Closing pursuant to the terms of the business combination marketing agreement entered into in </p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-53</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">ATLASCLEAR HOLDINGS, INC.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">SEPTEMBER 30, 2024</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_UGS0MvoYo0S4dGSQZp8EBw_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_UGS0MvoYo0S4dGSQZp8EBw_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">connection with Quantum&#8217;s initial public offering, would be waived in exchange for the issuance by the Company to Chardan of a convertible promissory note in the aggregate principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_EtlaPBpKUU2c_gjR402Mog" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_zH2UhEIZSU64iscU5iwr1Q">4,150,000</ix:nonFraction>. Such note (the &#8220;Original Chardan Note&#8221;) was issued by the Company at the Closing. Under ASC 815 the conversion feature was bifurcated resulting in a conversion liability of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_us-gaap_FairValueByLiabilityClassAxis_us-gaap_DerivativeFinancialInstrumentsLiabilitiesMember_KohR-xXZ3E6z7posXu6Z_A" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationRecurringBasisLiabilityIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_fEUvUgSxVEu--HAwLY5H6g">404,483</ix:nonFraction> at issuance.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the three-month period ended September 30, 2024, the Company received conversion notices for an aggregate principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_vyGADshG0UC5dW3Vy8zLhw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_MvZKb2d5lkC-IpfV2pq9QQ">725,000</ix:nonFraction>, and received a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_vyGADshG0UC5dW3Vy8zLhw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" id="Narr_6CjPQ3tqUEmkBT7WNfmw4Q">2,263,031</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock, of which <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_QuantumVenturesLLCMember_sdjlahoApU2mz3pHZnsB9Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_3u2MzTGUq0Ob9vIL6BGUcw">366,750</ix:nonFraction> were registered shares transferred from Quantum Ventures and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_FWwS3g8YR0avrrQwdS8hkQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_mbv34moqQkCpWYaGZxMPiA">127,159</ix:nonFraction> were registered shares transferred from Atlas FinTech, (see Note 8 above), and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_vyGADshG0UC5dW3Vy8zLhw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_aaPxMZH8ykew0m8nF9G22A">1,769,122</ix:nonFraction> were newly issued registered shares. During the three-month period ended September 30, 2024, the Company recognized $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_vyGADshG0UC5dW3Vy8zLhw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="0" id="Narr_TZ01MHqjA0iFcXsytmh5Yg">137,872</ix:nonFraction> in interest expense on the principal and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_vyGADshG0UC5dW3Vy8zLhw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfDebtDiscountPremium" scale="0" id="Narr_ajNDb-9g7UGdip4MrFQ8EQ">86,209</ix:nonFraction> of interest related to the amortization of the debt discount created with the derivative liability. During the three-month period ended September 30, 2024, Quantum Ventures transferred <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_vyGADshG0UC5dW3Vy8zLhw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_ax6W_tFMBkKkBy7j-Xqb4Q">145,606</ix:nonFraction> and Atlas fintech transferred <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_AtlasFintechMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_ob6VzXolhUery9tzxFF1Zw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_yitsIDK4BkKr14gpoYOX5A">52,590</ix:nonFraction> registered shares to pay for accrued interest of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_vyGADshG0UC5dW3Vy8zLhw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionOriginalDebtInterestAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_WwhSL_8dMkqQMxOVLQOlWg">212,803</ix:nonFraction>. As of September 30, 2024, the principal balance on the note is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_CtxUTnjxCEaXXZbU2KCVCg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_NxsSHBbVrkiRiwogr6Corw">3,425,000</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_CtxUTnjxCEaXXZbU2KCVCg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestPayableCurrentAndNoncurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_ClGaBPBvIUKPR7HQuNk92A">137,872</ix:nonFraction> in accrued interest net of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_CtxUTnjxCEaXXZbU2KCVCg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount" scale="0" id="Narr_LTQExt2oG0eT0K9HUdO4fA">280,355</ix:nonFraction> of unamortized debt discount for total carrying balance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_CtxUTnjxCEaXXZbU2KCVCg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConvertibleDebtCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_mXlPOc8nSEmjdyKGj_KZbw">3,282,518</ix:nonFraction>. See Note 14 for additional information on the fair value and change in fair value related to the derivative.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Original Chardan Note had a stated maturity date of February 9, 2028. Interest accrued at a rate per annum equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_EtlaPBpKUU2c_gjR402Mog" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_BpN3PVdRPUmWc0UsIvLM6Q">13</ix:nonFraction>%, and was payable quarterly on the first day of each calendar quarter. On each interest payment date, the accrued and unpaid interest was to be, at the election of the Company, either paid in cash or, subject to the satisfaction of certain conditions, in shares of Common Stock, at a rate equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_uh7fW_KGrEW3ZJCPEkqPoA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentInterestPayableInSharesAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice" scale="-2" id="Narr_Fd6VsODRTUiCrBHZp7JD9Q">85</ix:nonFraction>% of the VWAP for the trading day immediately prior to the applicable interest payment date. The Chardan Note was convertible, in whole or in part, into shares of Common Stock at the election of the holder at any time at a conversion price equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_uh7fW_KGrEW3ZJCPEkqPoA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRateAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice" scale="-2" id="Narr_jA9FOnvja0qmy35gqyqy7A">85</ix:nonFraction>% of the VWAP of the Common Stock for the trading day immediately preceding the applicable conversion date. In addition, on each conversion date the Company was required to pay to Chardan in cash (or, at the Company&#8217;s option and subject to certain conditions, a combination of cash and Common Stock) all accrued interest on the Original Chardan Note and all interest that would have otherwise been accrued on the amount of the Original Chardan Note being converted if such converted amount would be held to <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_1r5biushT0ylwRhCOD7hiQ;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">three years</span></span> after the applicable conversion date. Conversion of the Original Chardan Note, including the issuance of shares to pay interest thereon, was limited to the extent that such conversion would result in Chardan (together with its affiliates and any other persons acting as a group together with Chardan or its affiliates) beneficially owning in excess of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_EtlaPBpKUU2c_gjR402Mog" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:BeneficialOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_xRHJAjmweEmEI9Rn0ZxPkg">9.99</ix:nonFraction>% of the outstanding shares of Common Stock outstanding immediately prior to such conversion. The conversion price applicable to the Original Chardan Note was subject to customary adjustments for stock dividends, stock splits, reclassifications and the like, and was subject to price-based adjustment, on a &#8220;full ratchet&#8221; basis, in the event of any issuances of Common Stock, or securities convertible, exercisable or exchangeable for, Common Stock at a price below the then-applicable conversion price (subject to certain exceptions). The Original Chardan Note was subject to a demand for immediate repayment in cash upon the occurrence of certain events of default specified therein.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Also on February 9, 2024, the Company entered into a registration rights agreement with Chardan (the &#8220;Chardan Registration Rights Agreement&#8221;), pursuant to which the Company agreed, among other things, to file with the SEC within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_uh7fW_KGrEW3ZJCPEkqPoA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:PeriodToFileRegistrationStatementWithSec" id="Narr_WCKIcyUTz0eYrokkBoSvig">45 days</ix:nonNumeric> after the Closing Date a registration statement registering the resale of the shares of Common Stock issuable upon exercise of the Original Chardan Note and to use its reasonable best efforts to have such registration statement declared effective as soon as possible after filing. If the registration statement was not filed within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_uh7fW_KGrEW3ZJCPEkqPoA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:PeriodToFileRegistrationStatementWithSec" id="Narr_6k2hhFgMh02JLs0epf6fcQ">45 days</ix:nonNumeric> after the Closing or was not effective within a specified period after the Closing (or if effectiveness is subsequently suspended or terminated for at least <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_uh7fW_KGrEW3ZJCPEkqPoA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:MinimumPeriodForWhichRegistrationStatementWithSecIsSuspendedConsideredForIncreaseInInterestRateOnDebt" id="Narr_5dwMcm_usUuOQWWbCxI5kg">15 days</ix:nonNumeric>, subject to certain exceptions), then the interest rate of the Original Chardan Note increased by <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_uh7fW_KGrEW3ZJCPEkqPoA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:IncrementalWeeklyInterestRateIfRegistrationStatementIsNotFiledOrIsNotEffectiveOrTerminatedOrSuspended" scale="-2" id="Narr_irv_pj1bQ0KUQQUwG_NCLw">2</ix:nonFraction>% for each week that such event continued. The Chardan Registration Rights Agreement also provided that the Company was obligated to file additional registration statements under certain circumstances, and provided Chardan with customary &#8220;piggyback&#8221; registration rights.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On May 7, 2024, Chardan Capital Markets LLC (&#8220;Chardan&#8221;) filed a complaint in the Court of Chancery of the State of Delaware in an action entitled <i style="font-style:italic;">Chardan Capital Markets LLC v. AtlasClear Holdings, Inc.</i>, C.A. No. 2024-0480-LWW, for alleged breach of contract, breach of the implied covenant of good faith and fair dealing, and specific performance, alleging that the Company breached the Chardan Registration Rights Agreement, by failing to file a registration statement with the SEC to permit the public resale of certain registerable securities in an amount sufficient to cover the Original Chardan Note. Chardan alleged that the Company&#8217;s failure to file the registration statement left Chardan without the ability to convert and sell shares of the Company&#8217;s Common Stock as allowed for under the Original Chardan Note.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On October 23, 2024, the Company, Quantum Ventures, Chardan and Chardan Quantum LLC entered into an agreement pursuant to which they settled the claim referenced above, and any and all related claims (the &#8220;Settlement Agreement&#8221;). In connection with the </p></ix:continuation></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-54</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">ATLASCLEAR HOLDINGS, INC.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">SEPTEMBER 30, 2024</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_UGS0MvoYo0S4dGSQZp8EBw_cont2" continuedAt="Tb_UGS0MvoYo0S4dGSQZp8EBw_cont3"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Settlement Agreement, Chardan exchanged the Original Chardan Note for an amended non-interest bearing, convertible note in the aggregate principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_10_23_2024_To_10_23_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ChardanNoteMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_W7HVNQuk_kSnsuSaa4S-sA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_Pk7Vtyh2uEOuKFhmeFGkgA">5,209,764</ix:nonFraction> (as amended the &#8220;Chardan Note&#8221;). While the Chardan Note does not bear interest, it can be converted from time to time by Chardan into shares of Common Stock, on terms substantially similar to the conversion provisions in the Original Chardan Note, and any remaining outstanding principal is to be repaid in full on the same maturity date as the Original Chardan Note. (see Note 15 Subsequent Events for additional information).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Expense Settlements</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Carriage House Capital, Inc. &#8211; up to </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_2_19_2024_To_2_19_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_CarriageHouseCapitalIncMember_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_hpg90ZXJ-0WfS1cNB8wwww" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_E37INoAcvE2dlSb9s1VG6w">350,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> shares of Common Stock that were issued, or may become issuable, to Carriage House Capital, Inc. (&#8220;Carriage&#8221;), pursuant to the Consulting Agreement, dated as of February 19, 2024, between Carriage and the Company (the &#8220;Carriage Agreement&#8221;), as partial consideration for consulting services rendered to the Company, at the price per share of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_2_19_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_CarriageHouseCapitalIncMember_XQ6QhRH9vEabE0d5VKsqng" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_qq90bDQiw0uRB92tp9eqkA">4.98</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> on the day of issuance. The total consideration due under the Consulting Agreement is </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_2_19_2024_To_2_19_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_CarriageHouseCapitalIncMember_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_hpg90ZXJ-0WfS1cNB8wwww" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_JQDXP0XZKkqXCcQ_gcUlCg">350,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> shares of Common Stock, </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_2_19_2024_To_2_19_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_CarriageHouseCapitalIncMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_atch_DueUponSigningOfContractMember_AjsO9BnIG02MOA1mXmF4dQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_MJVkKn2vbUGzqcHxzCaDlw">100,007</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> shares of which were due upon signing of the contract and </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_2_19_2024_To_2_19_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_CarriageHouseCapitalIncMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_atch_DueInMonthsFourThroughTwelveFromDateOfSigningMember_-jQsy-sp8UmUugXO2J7TVw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_KPR-bNtsqUO9pjL6qVBYMw">27,777</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> shares of which are due in months four through twelve from the date of signing. On February 9, 2024, </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_CarriageHouseCapitalIncMember_eonXXKFzEU2BfQ_2-N2BLg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_dxGIWA1wMkqRQTbeyIqKzw">100,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> shares were issued, and were valued at $</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_CarriageHouseCapitalIncMember_g2VTpgC2kkCn-m9Xr0HdFw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr__VNGzbL8NkORQ6kaeGqbMw">4.98</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> per share as agreed upon consideration. The Stock payable for the remaining </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_CarriageHouseCapitalIncMember_W3m_KVc9rUiJuMB7wLR23A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForStockPayable" scale="0" id="Narr_78HRcpnxC02kiOXmSanNmQ">250,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> shares was valued at $</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_CarriageHouseCapitalIncMember_RQuA-R2zWkOk11PoZ1axAA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:StockPayableCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_rLj5VgtU5UOgC8T5tMd6Aw">1,244,965</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> and recorded as a stock payable. As of September 30, 2024 and June 30, 2024 the fair value of the </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" con