ember_JtXYLwmUbkW3iyGPpu0LUQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:NotesPayableCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_IftIs23H9UK5TGxGWDqXBw">393,966</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> included in Promissory note payable.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Toppan Merrill LLC &#8211; the Company issued to Toppan Merrill LLC (&#8220;Toppan&#8221;) a promissory note, dated as of February 9, 2024, in the aggregate principal amount of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ToppanNoteMember_AyGLS-4Yr0G6J4yRxtCHOw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_5ofNohi1D0Gd3HtYxfJbWQ">160,025</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> (the &#8220;Toppan Note&#8221;). The maturity date of the Toppan Note is February 8, 2026 and the note accrues interest at a rate of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ToppanNoteMember_AyGLS-4Yr0G6J4yRxtCHOw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_Zm9y0KM9BEyThAg5JZOJ8Q">13</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> per annum. The principal and interest payments due under the note is not payable in shares of Common Stock. As of September 30, 2024 and June 30, 2024, there was </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ToppanNoteMember_DA5kvIGHDEalFxp1jOUe-g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:NotesPayableCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_6N1oOv0bOEC3OSpEZeNIZQ">170,094</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> and </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ToppanNoteMember_cX9HVkfHGEyHit3qmyBgwA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:NotesPayableCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_TD1z_XPlW0CXJTLhJQvNOw">170,094</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, respectively, included in Promissory note payable.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Winston &amp; Strawn LLP &#8211; up to $</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_WinstonStrawnLlpMember_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_eIZsp7ntKEmJVXUKzAcv_g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:NumberOfSharesIssuableForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_3puL4vA-Q0GXywdUksvssw">2,500,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> in shares of Common Stock that may become issuable to Winston &amp; Strawn LLP (&#8220;Winston &amp; Strawn&#8221;), pursuant to a subscription agreement, dated as of February 9, 2024, between Winston &amp; Strawn and the Company (the &#8220;Winston &amp; Strawn Agreement&#8221;). Pursuant to the Winston Agreement, the Company may issue </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_WinstonStrawnLlpMember_26qCdzbJckamRRRSZ4ITLw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ValueOfSharesIssuableForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_SFJp0SNnu0-FY3f9xDQQPg">2,500,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> worth of shares of Common Stock as payment for legal services, in </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_installment_naZ3LCjrPUCQHLaJ5sTEcg" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_WinstonStrawnLlpMember_lPi19Ubt7kK9uqz3Jg6Ppw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:NumberOfInstallments" scale="0" id="Narr_b6imhGzfL0CIIO0zqekrJQ">three</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> equal installments of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_WinstonStrawnLlpMember_26qCdzbJckamRRRSZ4ITLw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ValueOfSharesIssuableForServicesInEachInstallment" scale="0" id="Narr_rhWeojOvXEiLdFU3tMXr9w">833,333</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> beginning on August 9, 2024. As of September 30, 2024 and June 30, 2024, the amount is included in Subscription agreement as an liability of $</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_WinstonStrawnLlpMember_cA9NwkFtuk-WalYYXr9KMQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:SubscriptionPayableLiabilityNoncurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_7OpCd0Q60UyWXSCd8Qx7zQ">2,460,488</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> and </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_WinstonStrawnLlpMember_jZXBN43BSky5-B5u6oFAMQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:SubscriptionPayableLiabilityNoncurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_Uc3BCw51xUe9MIk6kL9w-w">2,425,647</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, respectively. Due to the nature of the settlement terms, the subreption agreement was deemed to be a derivative liability to the Company as of June 30, 2024 under ASC 480. Change in fair value of the subscription agreement </span></td></tr></table></ix:continuation></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-55</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">ATLASCLEAR HOLDINGS, INC.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">SEPTEMBER 30, 2024</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_UGS0MvoYo0S4dGSQZp8EBw_cont3" continuedAt="Tb_UGS0MvoYo0S4dGSQZp8EBw_cont4"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">are measured at each reporting period with change reported in earnings. See valuation approach and further disclosure on Note 15.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Lead Nectar &#8211; up to </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_LeadNectarMember_1D_tqd4KHkCzJM62gglhwA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:NumberOfSharesIssuableForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_PcCH-jEYuESU0_fNr1KKDQ">12,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> shares of Common Stock that may become issuable to Lead Nectar in lieu of payment for internet marketing services the fair value of the shares at grant date was $</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_LeadNectarMember_IUUDkJP8Q0OxAAiRMSkfBA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:GrantDateFairValueOfShare" scale="0" id="Narr_02Io-52qukyLlmAwIWFZ2Q">2,578</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">.</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:12pt;"></div><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Secured Convertible Note Financing</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On February 9, 2024, Wilson-Davis and Quantum entered into a securities purchase agreement (the &#8220;Purchase Agreement&#8221;) with Funicular Funds, LP, a Delaware limited partnership (&#8220;Funicular&#8221;), pursuant to which the Company sold and issued to Funicular, on that date, a secured convertible promissory note in the principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_ss2YB6W7hEOkUgf4jvJrAQ">6,000,000</ix:nonFraction> (the &#8220;Funicular Note&#8221;) for a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_wFzhwzJNl0u3uSs7EAKljQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromNotesPayable" scale="0" id="Narr_wUx-bLgDAEK2xbqzVEXlNw">6,000,000</ix:nonFraction>, in a private placement (the &#8220;Secured Note Financing&#8221;). The proceeds raised in the Note Financing were used to pay a portion of the purchase price paid at Closing to the Wilson-Davis Sellers.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Funicular Note has a stated maturity date of November 9, 2025. Interest accrues at a rate per annum equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_Ty5381x2vkWosZe1aU5WFA">12.5</ix:nonFraction>%, and is payable semi-annually on each June 30 and December 31. On each interest payment date, the accrued and unpaid interest shall, at the election of the Company in its sole discretion, be either paid in cash or paid in-kind by increasing the principal amount of the Funicular Note. In the event of an Event of Default (as defined in the Funicular Note), in addition to Funicular&#8217;s other rights and remedies, the interest rate would increase to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentInterestRateInEventOfDefault" scale="-2" id="Narr_iGwGQDECc06oMfOf0wEckg">20</ix:nonFraction>% per annum. The Funicular Note is convertible, in whole or in part, into shares of Common Stock at the election of the holder at any time at an initial conversion price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" scale="0" id="Narr_iHPITaufG0qDoh5xjCHZOA">10.00</ix:nonFraction> per share (the &#8220;Conversion Price&#8221;). The Conversion Price is subject to adjustment monthly to a price equal to the trailing <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_LQ4M5hqi1EqO2C4N7zkpIw" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_wFzhwzJNl0u3uSs7EAKljQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleThresholdTradingDaysOverWhichVolumeWeightedAverageStockPriceConsideredForMonthlyAdjustmentsToConversionPrice" scale="0" id="Narr_ahP0e2A2Qk218x7nIscElA">five</ix:nonFraction>-day VWAP, subject to a floor of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPriceFloor" scale="0" id="Narr_wYHwKczndkqPz4YcHR9uMg">2.00</ix:nonFraction> per share (provided that if the Company sells stock at an effective price below $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_7cgCTLwN_kO60mzqGwrYPw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_ULUS2T7ABUCjKgTVEolwnA">2.00</ix:nonFraction> per share, such floor would be reduced to such effective price), and is subject to customary adjustments for stock dividends, stock splits, reclassifications and the like. The Company has the right to redeem the Funicular Note upon <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_wFzhwzJNl0u3uSs7EAKljQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:DebtInstrumentRedemptionNumberOfDaysNotice" id="Narr_lodt0jnTB0GaZH9TcRRTSw">30 days</ix:nonNumeric>&#8217; notice after the earlier of August 7, 2024 and the effectiveness of the Registration Statement (as defined in the Funicular Note), and Funicular would have the right to require the Company to redeem the Note in connection with a Change of Control (as defined in the Note), in each case for a price equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_wFzhwzJNl0u3uSs7EAKljQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentRedemptionPricePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_VJB-qlceoESLzCqIXqKwvw">101</ix:nonFraction>% of the outstanding principal amount of the Note plus accrued and unpaid interest. The Funicular Note contains covenants which, among other things, limit the ability of the Company and its subsidiaries to incur additional indebtedness, incur additional liens and sell its assets or properties.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As a result of the delay in filing the registration statement the Company incurred $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_Lm9US_Lk-ki7iTJmSDhqrQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtIssuanceCosts" scale="0" id="Narr_K71UUIy4CkyAfbbXW8q3AA">1,500,000</ix:nonFraction> in fees through June 30, 2024 which has been added to the principal of the note. As of June 30, 2024, the Company recognized $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_z-mg2s9h00eu-SC2jStizA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AccruedInterestExpensePrincipalAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_RAF6WkpCc0yrb9HWrQ0XiQ">328,767</ix:nonFraction> in interest expense on the principal and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_z-mg2s9h00eu-SC2jStizA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AccruedInterestExpenseAmortizationOfDebtDiscount" scale="0" id="Narr_uMBxTVgAu0-ibq4exuYlig">279,032</ix:nonFraction> of interest related to the amortization of the debt discount described above. As of June 30, 2024 the carrying value of the notes is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_NonrelatedPartyMember_NSsojneLEE2wC-AZyfdN0A" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SecuredDebtCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_H9nZElouOUC4xj7fqu5rYw">6,857,101</ix:nonFraction> net of discount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_i2gUnkY77UuxcoehQ3RXew" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscountPremiumNet" scale="0" id="Narr_c70PDtX9x0WlFhkIUywbmA">971,666</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of September 30, 2024, the company recognized $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_TBXlWItwGEuS_UMaD8_s4Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AccruedInterestExpensePrincipalAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_RY_bhS4acEOR7LzcCR0gMg">246,660</ix:nonFraction> in interest expense on the principal and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_TBXlWItwGEuS_UMaD8_s4Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AccruedInterestExpenseAmortizationOfDebtDiscount" scale="0" id="Narr_LwC7Z1k67UCpYkZHuBCxoQ">180,085</ix:nonFraction> of interest related to the amortization of the debt discount described above. As of September 30, 2024, the carrying value of the notes is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_NonrelatedPartyMember_umjfxvYz50ag17XIpJRxfw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SecuredDebtCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_LtznOSFiSEKROaPwRpjZ7g">7,066,449</ix:nonFraction>, net of discount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_ll4s9jxr1U6ujm8UtL-j9w" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscountPremiumNet" scale="0" id="Narr_ZRGNyB2tkUy5PCIzj9wejw">791,581</ix:nonFraction>. During the three month period the Quantum Ventures transferred <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_K-PO_vtwlkKIB2NWzCm36g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:StockTransferredDuringPeriodByRelatedPartySharesConversionOfConvertibleSecuritiesInterest" scale="0" id="Narr_mG9RnMVsH0mkOYGrtl9NOw">368,004</ix:nonFraction> registered shares to pay for accrued interest of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_FunicularNoteMember_K-PO_vtwlkKIB2NWzCm36g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentAmountConversionOfInterestOfConvertibleNotes" scale="0" id="Narr_2V8rNVUXQEOjzAfUKFVPxw">217,373</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As a result of the Company&#8217;s lack of authorized shares to satisfy its share obligations, the note now falls under ASC 815 and is required to be accounted for at fair value with change in fair value recorded in the statement of operations. See valuation approach and further disclosure on Note 14. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Sellers Note</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">As a result of the acquisition of Wilson-Davis the company issued (i) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermNotesMember_nYbnF4iAkEaBhpOEdZhDNg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_pZrZZFyO2UaQBcttUe9d9A">5,000,000</ix:nonFraction> in aggregate principal amount of notes due <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermNotesMember_GV-WVXMMnEClCIsE5pFYNQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm" id="Narr_FLR149FvOkeF2wAEiCNyZA">90 days</ix:nonNumeric> after the Closing Date (the &#8220;Short-Term Notes&#8221;) and (ii) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_AtHhdO1dskuOq0-eE8jopA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_BONUjuIPSk6Qpt_VelJz-A">7,971,000</ix:nonFraction> in aggregate principal amount of notes due <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_gaRrnmN5KkiI4ZTCTzeSdQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm" id="Narr_QdQnzBZI6ke1CmwVqX3c4w">24 months</ix:nonNumeric> after the Closing Date (the &#8220;Long-Term Notes&#8221; and, together with the Short-Term Notes, the &#8220;Seller Notes&#8221;). The Short-Term Notes accrue interest at a rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermNotesMember_nYbnF4iAkEaBhpOEdZhDNg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_lIiDZLza60yqfQNLLc1FZA">9</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, payable quarterly in arrears, in shares of Common Stock at a rate equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermNotesMember_GV-WVXMMnEClCIsE5pFYNQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentInterestPayableInSharesAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice" scale="-2" id="Narr_udtMf5ACak2WPzsl0NEWsg">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the trailing seven-trading day VWAP prior to payment (or, at the Company&#8217;s option, cash), and are convertible at the option of the holder at any time during the continuance of an event of default, at a rate equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermNotesMember_GV-WVXMMnEClCIsE5pFYNQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRateAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice.IfEventOfDefaultOccursAndIsContinuing" scale="-2" id="Narr_l6DMiMyJ70mtB8WTbKmuYQ">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the trailing seven-trading day VWAP prior to conversion. The Long-Term Notes accrue interest at a rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_AtHhdO1dskuOq0-eE8jopA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_99lbur8MZ0ujbjPZdaXlbQ">13</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, payable quarterly in arrears, in shares of Common Stock at a rate equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_gaRrnmN5KkiI4ZTCTzeSdQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentInterestPayableInSharesAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice" scale="-2" id="Narr_jhTD1xzWFESFVRQhi7LS9A">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the trailing seven-trading day VWAP prior to payment (or, at the Company&#8217;s option, in cash), and are convertible at the option </p></ix:continuation></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-56</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">ATLASCLEAR HOLDINGS, INC.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">SEPTEMBER 30, 2024</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_UGS0MvoYo0S4dGSQZp8EBw_cont4" continuedAt="Tb_UGS0MvoYo0S4dGSQZp8EBw_cont5"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">of the holder at any time commencing six months after the Closing Date, at a rate equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_gaRrnmN5KkiI4ZTCTzeSdQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentInterestPayableInSharesAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice" scale="-2" id="Narr_e5CxbdRu7UC9mq8ylhl3cA">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the trailing seven-trading day VWAP prior to conversion (or <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermNotesMember_gaRrnmN5KkiI4ZTCTzeSdQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionRateAsPercentageOfTrailingSpecifiedTradingDayVolumeWeightedAverageSharePrice.IfEventOfDefaultOccursAndIsContinuing" scale="-2" id="Narr_zunDjNPtd02mRZCuDBnWOg">85</ix:nonFraction>% if an event of default occurs and is continuing).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the three-month ended September 30, 2024, the Company received conversion notice for a total $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionOriginalDebtPrincipalAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_0PixshrwDEqHWTfhHfa1kQ">359,896</ix:nonFraction> in short term loan principal and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermSellerNotesMember_r7JXa2g-y0eACzO2v1z_qA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionOriginalDebtInterestAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_QRLD0J2a7EWy7fzS92Y_ug">7,530</ix:nonFraction> of short term loan interest, receiving a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_SellersNoteMember_mrBDlej-00-jLPeyVteRmA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_fyryV59OP0CGTE4j2P6eSA">1,862,116</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock newly issued registered shares. During the three-months ended September 30, 2024, the company recognized $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermSellerNotesMember_r7JXa2g-y0eACzO2v1z_qA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="0" id="Narr_hUfM3sIl20WibTttZ8ZD3Q">158,333</ix:nonFraction> in interest expense on the short-term principal, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermSellerNotesMember_hhbAMT6NoEeCojXWrAZrZA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="0" id="Narr_vpgM18gl2kKv2QHhZ30V2w">259,063</ix:nonFraction> in interest expense on the long-term principal and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermSellerNotesMember_hhbAMT6NoEeCojXWrAZrZA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfDebtDiscountPremium" scale="0" id="Narr_A1HY4HZxeUmIqkyTFgusMg">99,890</ix:nonFraction> of interest related to the amortization of the debt discount on long-term loan created with the derivative liability. During the three month period the Quantum Ventures transferred <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_SellersNoteMember_mrBDlej-00-jLPeyVteRmA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:StockTransferredDuringPeriodByRelatedPartySharesConversionOfConvertibleSecuritiesInterest" scale="0" id="Narr_phUbosJGW0m9bsF4YaeKog">368,004</ix:nonFraction> registered shares to pay for accrued interest of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermSellerNotesMember_r7JXa2g-y0eACzO2v1z_qA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentAmountConversionOfInterestOfConvertibleNotes" scale="0" id="Narr_E3G5-10QS0KKAtdw9zKOPg">92,083</ix:nonFraction> on short-term loan and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermSellerNotesMember_hhbAMT6NoEeCojXWrAZrZA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentAmountConversionOfInterestOfConvertibleNotes" scale="0" id="Narr_seIUcdXfuE-jQ4JqRKis5g">259,058</ix:nonFraction> on long-term loan. As of September 30, 2024 the Principal balance on the short-term loan is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermSellerNotesMember_axr9Bl0l20yBQM_PcuQXbQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_wG7zE_iV20KbTTflEawwNQ">4,640,104</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermSellerNotesMember_axr9Bl0l20yBQM_PcuQXbQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestPayableCurrentAndNoncurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_GLCyRDcU8UyeFDt4DzesXw">150,803</ix:nonFraction> in accrued interest net of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermSellerNotesMember_axr9Bl0l20yBQM_PcuQXbQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscountPremiumNet" scale="0" id="Narr_dWgnxI6iiku0vFwyzAdxcQ">0</ix:nonFraction> of unamortized debt discount for total carrying balance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_ShortTermSellerNotesMember_axr9Bl0l20yBQM_PcuQXbQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ShortTermMergerFinancingNetCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_DwUpoFrxCEKFqa7fRXZfrA">4,790,907</ix:nonFraction> in short-term loans. As of September 30, 2024 the Principal balance on the long-term loan is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermSellerNotesMember_rryw0X3B6kSGotSpDpqhOg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_vYN3EReTok-CsLCq9igJ2Q">7,971,197</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermSellerNotesMember_rryw0X3B6kSGotSpDpqhOg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestPayableCurrentAndNoncurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_mx0z4T5rd0KJfguSArpcZA">259,064</ix:nonFraction> in accrued interest net of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermSellerNotesMember_rryw0X3B6kSGotSpDpqhOg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscountPremiumNet" scale="0" id="Narr_Scz2EfXQ6kqzYyCE-Mc48w">521,646</ix:nonFraction> of unamortized debt discount for total carrying balance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_atch_LongTermSellerNotesMember_rryw0X3B6kSGotSpDpqhOg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:LongTermMergerFinancingNet" scale="0" id="Narr_GxcyMfsn0ki6x9rncx1PGQ">7,708,615</ix:nonFraction> in long-term loans.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Contingent Guarantee</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In connection with the acquisition of Wilson-Davis, Founder shares were transferred to cover a cash deficit of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_7_2024_To_2_7_2024_hkg-r-fAYkKc6nGBsQkTzw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ValueOfFounderSharesTransferredToCoverCashDeficit" scale="0" id="Narr_d2eS78YfUE6dNCzchQBWWA">6,000,000</ix:nonFraction>. The share have a make-whole provision that require to be accounted for under ASC 480. The Company has valued the obligation as of June 30, 2024 of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_i2gUnkY77UuxcoehQ3RXew" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ContingentGuarantee" scale="0" id="Narr_2cMaFrdzBECCVFepbD9jvw">3,256,863</ix:nonFraction> based on the cash value that would need to be renumerated by the Company. The value of the cash that would be paid was deemed to be the fair value of the contingent guarantee. The Company analyzed the public sales of the shares transferred to determine the amount of cash recovered less the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_fGwcjU1I102YJQ8732FGSg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ValueOfFounderSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_KVit0gpWREWB2Kbw48_aug">4,000,000</ix:nonFraction> contingent guarantee resulting in a liability due of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_0wZrSd3v6k-qEjehB7QWOA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ContingentGuarantee" scale="0" id="Narr_dpXdJSZvxkChMRx_Lasa8w">3,256,863</ix:nonFraction>. As of February 9, 2024 the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_fGwcjU1I102YJQ8732FGSg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:SharesOfFounderSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_EkXX1DL3YU6hS8gJ_cSwWw">885,010</ix:nonFraction> shares transferred by the Founder were valued at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtMember_l3C4lfLWK0qXNAPiyDEgMQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ValueOfFounderSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_9Ele85ZQykmUzcQYP4IyRg">8,850,100</ix:nonFraction> which was greater than the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_2_9_2024_fGwcjU1I102YJQ8732FGSg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ValueOfFounderSharesTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_YtAN0UQjjUeSOtWsv7vq5w">4,000,000</ix:nonFraction> guaranteed value as such the value of the guarantee was deemed to be <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_2_9_2024_0wZrSd3v6k-qEjehB7QWOA" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:ContingentGuaranteeDeemedValue" scale="0" id="Narr_SdxV7_Vvk0uRfE4boBe2Kw">zero</ix:nonFraction> on February 9, 2024. As a result of the decrease in stock prices through June 30, 2024 the Sellers have recovered $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_9_2024_To_6_30_2024_BvHppaDyUEaptAEFex59jQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AmountOfCashRecoveredThroughTransferOfShares" scale="0" id="Narr_MurteYY5rkmmnf-th3ny9A">743,137</ix:nonFraction> in cash through sales of the shares transferred resulting in the value of the liability as of June 30, 2024 to be $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_i2gUnkY77UuxcoehQ3RXew" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ContingentGuarantee" scale="0" id="Narr_xGeiI2UAQkaHqau9b_95NA">3,256,863</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the three-month period ended September 30, 2024, the Atlas FinTech agreed to transfer <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesAcquisitions" scale="0" id="Narr_zapG6us9HkyiuMlkFbuwfg">1,234,990</ix:nonFraction> in registered shares to the sellers under the contingent guarantee, resulting in a reduction in the contingent guarantee of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:IncreaseDecreaseContingentGuarantee" scale="0" id="Narr_j79uOvM9ckKiZoSegGzt8A">1,210,290</ix:nonFraction> based on the fair value of the shares transferred on the transfer date. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On August 9, 2024, the Company entered into an agreement to modify the terms of the contingent guarantee where the Company agreed to enter into a convertible note on the amount that has not yet been recovered through share issuances of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_8_9_2024_To_8_9_2024_iJA3JUVztk6N3_5oNA3QtQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:StockIssuedForContingentGuarantee" scale="0" id="Narr_1M-7fKllWEWii4yiTT0QvQ">2,886,347</ix:nonFraction> plus a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_8_9_2024_77xcyK7hi06UXjgWMfYdFA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ConvenienceFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_OwbDfZmbQUKCqgfk5ukjyg">5</ix:nonFraction>% convenience fee applied resulting in the Company issuing a convertible note of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_8_9_2024_To_8_9_2024_iJA3JUVztk6N3_5oNA3QtQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ConvertibleNotesIssuedForContingentConsideration" scale="0" id="Narr_Gb-oA1691kuVoj_EtAV6Kg">3,030,665</ix:nonFraction>. This Convertible Promissory Note (this &#8220;Merger Financing&#8221;) is being issued pursuant to that certain Post-Closing Agreement dated effective August 9, 2024 (the &#8220;Agreement&#8221;), by and between the Company and the former stockholders of Wilson-Davis, to address the remaining Gross Proceeds Shortfall that cannot be remedied by the transfer of Additional Shares. Capitalized terms used but not defined herein shall have the meanings given to them in the Stock Purchase Agreement, as defined in the Agreement. The note was analyzed under ASC 480 and ASC 815, as a result of the Company not having sufficient shares authorized to settled the convertible note, the Merger Financing note falls under ASC 815. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Under ASC 815 the conversion feature was bifurcated resulting in a conversion liability of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:EmbeddedDerivativeFairValueOfEmbeddedDerivativeLiabilitys" scale="0" id="Narr_JZhfepfTsUaNTDHXUK5rng">113,044</ix:nonFraction> for the Merger Financing and at issuance. As of September 30, 2024, the Company recognized $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:InterestOnContingentGuarantee" scale="0" id="Narr_To6hHiYv9keVo4M8vxGOHg">56,909</ix:nonFraction> in interest expense on the principal and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AmortizationOfDebtDiscountPremiumContingentGuarantee" scale="0" id="Narr_BxCMFOmFHEeCIDEEFJh3wQ">10,707</ix:nonFraction> of interest related to the amortization of the debt discount created with the derivative liability. See Note 14 for additional information on the fair value of the derivative.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Tau Agreement - ELOC</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On July 31, 2024, the Company and Tau Investment Partners LLC (&#8220;Tau&#8221;) entered into an at-the-market agreement (the &#8220;ELOC&#8221;). Pursuant to the ELOC, upon the terms of and subject to the satisfaction of certain conditions, the Company has the right from time to time at its option to direct Tau to purchase up to a specified maximum amount of shares of the Common Stock, up to a maximum aggregate purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_vZm1uOJdO0it2axBCJJzNA" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:MaximumAggregatePurchasePrice" scale="6" id="Narr_Lo3NRyTUlUiVxcaGMxRnLw">10</ix:nonFraction> million (the &#8220;Aggregate Limit&#8221;), over a <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_8uS8yEBVrU22arfxWbsQ1A;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">24-month</span></span> term commencing on the date of the ELOC. The Company may request, on dates determined by it, individual advances up to the greater of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_vZm1uOJdO0it2axBCJJzNA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ThresholdSharesOfIndividualAdvancesThatCanBeRequested" scale="0" id="Narr_7ThZjRiibUWPNJRQYfKNxg">100,000</ix:nonFraction> shares or such amount as is equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_7_31_2024_To_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_t6JCR-VzykCV4u9eXbWLNw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:IndividualAdvancesRequestedPercentageOfAverageDailyVolumeOfCommonStockTraded" scale="-2" id="Narr_geUixQAdDEmZdREbG0r5UA">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the average daily volume traded of the Common Stock during the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_LQ4M5hqi1EqO2C4N7zkpIw" contextRef="Duration_7_31_2024_To_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_t6JCR-VzykCV4u9eXbWLNw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:IndividualAdvancesRequestedThresholdTradingDays" scale="0" id="Narr_bR5sneVLakW6Pntu-5gpxQ">30</ix:nonFraction> trading days immediately prior to the date the Company requests each advance, subject to the Aggregate Limit. Any such advance will reduce amounts that the Company can request for future advances and draw downs. The purchase price payable for the shares sold pursuant to any advance will be equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_7_31_2024_To_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_t6JCR-VzykCV4u9eXbWLNw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:SharesSoldPurchasePricePayableAsPercentageOfLowestVolumeWeightedAveragePriceOfCommonStock" scale="-2" id="Narr_Q0CGmyjCdkmiM9bNnrwNTA">97</ix:nonFraction>% of the lowest </p></ix:continuation></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-57</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">ATLASCLEAR HOLDINGS, INC.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">SEPTEMBER 30, 2024</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_UGS0MvoYo0S4dGSQZp8EBw_cont5" continuedAt="Tb_UGS0MvoYo0S4dGSQZp8EBw_cont6"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">volume weighted average price of the Common Stock during a pricing period of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_LQ4M5hqi1EqO2C4N7zkpIw" contextRef="Duration_7_31_2024_To_7_31_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_t6JCR-VzykCV4u9eXbWLNw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:IndividualAdvancesRequestedThresholdConsecutiveTradingDays" scale="0" id="Narr_SK7pNsB3IkqWR9wKFEmxrQ">three</ix:nonFraction> consecutive trading days following Tau&#8217;s receipt of the applicable advance notice. Tau&#8217;s obligation to purchase the shares the Company requests to sell pursuant to any advance is conditioned upon, in addition to certain other customary closing conditions, the continued effectiveness of a registration statement pursuant to which Tau may freely sell the shares to be received.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The issuance and sale of the shares of Common Stock pursuant to the ELOC will be exempt from the registration requirements of the Securities Act of 1933, as amended, in accordance with Section 4(a)(2) thereof. The Company has agreed to file a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for the resale by Tau of at least <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_ll4s9jxr1U6ujm8UtL-j9w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_9DmS5qthpUON8wprI25eaw">10,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock (the &#8220;Commitment Amount&#8221;).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company will sell to the Investor the Common Stock at a Purchase Price equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_0qQADdJc2ku5k_rlrBteRw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:SharesSoldPurchasePricePayableAsPercentageOfLowestVolumeWeightedAveragePriceOfCommonStock" scale="-2" id="Narr_FVIDBfB6a0e60Gb8lJ2szw">97</ix:nonFraction>% of the lowest VWAP of the Common Stock during a pricing period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_0qQADdJc2ku5k_rlrBteRw" format="ixt-sec:durday" name="atch:PurchasePriceThresholdConsecutiveTradingDays" id="Narr_cTw2CiwJdEWTaD3EW9nvGQ">3</ix:nonNumeric> consecutive trading days commencing on the trading day the Advance Notice is received by the Investor. If the VWAP on any trading day during a pricing period under is below a minimum price set by the Company in connection with each Advance Notice (the &#8220;MAP&#8221;) then for each such trading day (i) the requested Advance amount shall automatically be reduced by an amount equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_XHtHSPgHdUCWm-ekmQpOnA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ReductionInAdvanceAmountPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_WpgARgLZfkW93GWbsZU-sQ">33</ix:nonFraction>% of the original requested Advance amount and (ii) such day shall not be factored into the determination of the Market Price. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company analyzed both the Commitment Amount and the Commitment fee under ASC 480 and ASC 815. The Commitment Amount is classified as a liability and is initially measured at fair value. The Commitment Amount is subsequently measured at fair value at each reporting period with subsequent changes in fair value recorded in earnings. ASC 815-40-35-8 through 35-9 require an issuer to reassess the classification of both freestanding equity contracts and embedded equity features at each balance sheet date. If the classification changes because of events occurring during the reporting period, the instrument is reclassified as of the date of the event that caused the reclassification.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As consideration the Company will issue to the Investor a fee equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_NaQJI6k4XUi3bg8YS432Tg" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_XHtHSPgHdUCWm-ekmQpOnA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:CommitmentFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_SOq6__8KUUyquDt0zY07kw">1.25</ix:nonFraction>% of the Commitment Amount (the &#8220;Commitment Fee&#8221;) due in shares upon closing based on the closing price on the day prior to approval of the S-1. As the Commitment Fee is a variable share obligation within the scope of ASC 480, it must be initially and subsequently measured at fair value through earnings at each reporting period.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">When estimating the fair value, the Company has followed the guidance in ASC 820 Fair Value Measurement.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As both the Commitment Amount and Commitment Fee were issued in a single transaction and are both remeasured to fair value through earnings in each subsequent reporting period, the proceeds received should be allocated to each freestanding financial instrument on a relative fair value basis. As such, as of September 30, 2024 the Company requested advance notices for a total of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_XHtHSPgHdUCWm-ekmQpOnA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:SharesToBeIssuedAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_NZI3ZU6NpkyGcLU1xdQrqw">441,524</ix:nonFraction> which resulted in approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_XHtHSPgHdUCWm-ekmQpOnA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_mycwAM--vEWwVmH6XuAmrQ">2,310,000</ix:nonFraction> shares to be issued. The Company recorded the initial fair value of the Commitment Amount at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_XHtHSPgHdUCWm-ekmQpOnA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:CommitmentAmountInitialFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_gD_e4N097ki-t1umrW7Opg">391,017</ix:nonFraction> and the Commitment Fee at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_XHtHSPgHdUCWm-ekmQpOnA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:CommitmentFeesPayable" scale="0" id="Narr_5rraxjArnEmJPIc-iaaPZA">50,506</ix:nonFraction> for total receivable under the ELOC of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_XHtHSPgHdUCWm-ekmQpOnA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:CommitmentFeeReceivable" scale="0" id="Narr_Vb9KPu2aNk-HUXCl_-34FQ">441,524</ix:nonFraction>. The receivable under the Commitment Amount for the advances is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_XHtHSPgHdUCWm-ekmQpOnA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:CommitmentAmountForAdvances" scale="0" id="Narr_BswV1cyt7EeSXD2eeQzavw">169,084</ix:nonFraction> as of September 30, 2024. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company then recognized a day one charge to earning to record the Commitment Amount and the Commitment Fee at fair value at issuance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_XHtHSPgHdUCWm-ekmQpOnA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:CommitmentAmountFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_vrm23inVTUag4Bmoh0LSUA">575,136</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_XHtHSPgHdUCWm-ekmQpOnA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:CommitmentFeeFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_kGprFcwR5EKTghKC8cBg1g">74,289</ix:nonFraction> reflecting an initial fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_XHtHSPgHdUCWm-ekmQpOnA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:InitialFairValueCommitmentFee" scale="0" id="Narr_FDBFjdTgiEOgiXeQcQAv4g">966,153</ix:nonFraction> for the Commitment Amount and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_XHtHSPgHdUCWm-ekmQpOnA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:InitialFairValueCommitmentAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_Mopgw7C8cE2RpKSOBrMk1w">124,796</ix:nonFraction> for the Commitment Fee liability. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Tau sold and settled <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_0qQADdJc2ku5k_rlrBteRw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_mDMR5_paREe-6YdfyczK2A">1,445,527</ix:nonFraction> of the shares which were issued under the ELOC resulting in realized sale of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_0qQADdJc2ku5k_rlrBteRw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:SaleOfSharesUnderSharePurchaseAgreement" scale="0" id="Narr_Q8SbZItsVUOFAZMKYpDD8g">303,001</ix:nonFraction>, Tau purchased the shares for $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_0qQADdJc2ku5k_rlrBteRw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:StockPurchasedDuringPeriodSharesSharePurchaseAgreement" scale="0" id="Narr_xEvBi3k_lEC2Crtk__NL6w">272,440</ix:nonFraction> resulting in a realized gain to the Company of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_0qQADdJc2ku5k_rlrBteRw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:PurchaseOfSharesUnderSharePurchaseAgreement" scale="0" id="Narr_7REsACOkHEucQHUD7VWWRA">30,562</ix:nonFraction>. As a result, the Company has a subscription receivable of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_XHtHSPgHdUCWm-ekmQpOnA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockShareSubscribedButUnissuedSubscriptionsReceivable" scale="0" id="Narr_kj9KgLlgBkamhZ_1Ckkmkg">154,619</ix:nonFraction> and received $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_0qQADdJc2ku5k_rlrBteRw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock" scale="0" id="Narr_NTefh_H29U6ashmhoS8wQQ">148,382</ix:nonFraction> in cash proceeds under the ELOC. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">There are <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_0qQADdJc2ku5k_rlrBteRw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:SharesNotSettledDuringPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_fPcR7SxEX0SrWRqXhdECKg">864,473</ix:nonFraction> shares which have not yet been settled which were fair valued as of September 30, 2024 resulting in a change in the fair value of the Commitment amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_0qQADdJc2ku5k_rlrBteRw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ChangeInFairValueOfCommitmentAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_QuS4cDWb4kmAiGVBoJEeow">229,407</ix:nonFraction> and a change in the fair value of the Commitment fee of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_atch_AtMarketAgreementMember_0qQADdJc2ku5k_rlrBteRw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:ChangeInFairValueOfCommitmentFee" scale="0" id="Narr_qp_olkB0IE2xf96b_Ha6XA">44,848</ix:nonFraction>. See Note 14 for additional information regarding the fair value method and related disclosures. See foot Note 14 for additional disclosures.</p></ix:continuation></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-58</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">ATLASCLEAR HOLDINGS, INC.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">SEPTEMBER 30, 2024</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_UGS0MvoYo0S4dGSQZp8EBw_cont6"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Indemnification Agreements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On the Closing Date, in connection with the Closing, the Company entered into indemnification agreements with each of its directors and executive officers, which provide for indemnification and advancements by the Company of certain expenses and costs under certain circumstances. The indemnification agreements provide that AtlasClear Holdings will indemnify each of its directors and executive officers against any and all expenses incurred by that director or executive officer because of his or her status as a director or officer of AtlasClear Holdings, to the fullest extent permitted by Delaware law, the Amended and Restated Certificate of Incorporation and the Amended and Restated Bylaws.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Wilson-Davis </b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On February 27, 2018, an extended hearing panel of the Department of Enforcement of the Financial Industry Regulatory Authority, Inc. (&#8220;FINRA&#8221;), Office of Hearing Officers, issued its decision ordering fines aggregating $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_2_27_2018_To_2_27_2018_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_WilsonDavisCoIncMember_1r7g4aLK40WF7NIV1DHMiA" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LossContingencyDamagesAwardedValue" scale="6" id="Narr_tnBBFozIUkmrw2do1eGwQw">1.47</ix:nonFraction> million for violations of the applicable short sales and anti-money laundering rules. Wilson-Davis appealed the decision to the National Adjudicatory Council (&#8220;NAC&#8221;). On December 19, 2019, NAC issued its decision ordering that the fines be reduced by $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_12_19_2019_To_12_19_2019_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_WilsonDavisCoIncMember_FhL9zLpBy0aMhIh48QWg4g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:LossContingencyReductionInDamageAwarded" scale="0" id="Narr_3TCMnp4tL0an4IUpLLZIDQ">205,000</ix:nonFraction> to an aggregate $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_12_19_2019_To_12_19_2019_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_WilsonDavisCoIncMember_FhL9zLpBy0aMhIh48QWg4g" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LossContingencyDamagesAwardedValue" scale="6" id="Narr_iuVbNWq6R0-Waf6J-SZ7GA">1.265</ix:nonFraction> million. Wilson-Davis made a timely appeal to the SEC to hear the case. Pursuant to FINRA rules, Wilson-Davis&#8217;s timely appeal of the decision to the SEC deferred the effectiveness of the findings and sanctions. Due to the disparity in the range of fines of similar cases, Wilson-Davis believes that the final amount is not reasonably estimable. Wilson-Davis has booked a contingent liability totaling $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_12_19_2019_dei_LegalEntityAxis_atch_WilsonDavisCoIncMember_vUD_8MBUDUW7qc_iO5rQpw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LitigationReserveNoncurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_HrzPmeu8pUiyXHswVEFqFw">100,000</ix:nonFraction>, which represents the estimated low end of the possible range of fines. On December 28, 2023, the SEC issued an Opinion sustaining FINRA&#8217;s findings of violations against Wilson-Davis. The Opinion set aside the fines FINRA imposed on Wilson-Davis for the Reg SHO violations and the supervisory and AML violations. The SEC remanded the case to FINRA to reconsider the appropriate sanctions.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_IluKGPY7l0G8l1fHxICJ5A" continuedAt="Tb_IluKGPY7l0G8l1fHxICJ5A_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTE&#160;10. ACQUISITION OF WILSON-DAVIS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Prior to the Closing, AtlasClear and the Company entered into two amendments to the Broker-Dealer Acquisition Agreement with Wilson-Davis and the then-owners of Wilson-Davis.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As a result of the closing of the business combination the Company allocated the purchase price with the acquisition of Wilson-Davis under the acquisition method of accounting. The final allocation of the purchase consideration for the Mergers will be determined after the completion of a thorough analysis to determine the fair value of all assets acquired and liabilities assumed, but in no event later than one year following the completion of the Mergers. During the quarter ended the Company revised the deferred tax liabilities that resulted from the business combination, thus reducing the goodwill value.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-59</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">ATLASCLEAR HOLDINGS, INC.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">SEPTEMBER 30, 2024</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);min-height:11.5pt;"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><a id="Tc_pYtCtDI7SkSsk99lDLMB1g_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_8OAS1otrbkS_sW_dlF0BRA_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_B7gi_baRskStAQ6VGR24XQ_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_JcQ-xzl2U0Weg4_IJaIqOw_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_7nQbqN7TakWMiz3LQeQfuA_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_ONy_bm2c-0C0qm-y1N0bFg_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_aybYo82ut0i449dUQFSZ3g_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_LN1Wb4VPG0WZuXHLsYjNKQ_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_Ua16BWMeu0SjY66kvEyALg_8_2"></a><a id="Tc_lxAeKSd-REKfUml4uChcPw_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_FxaJsoFi1UWh9pt_xzXWjA_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_3VU-s9K-7EKFbxVsXPfa-Q_11_0"></a><a id="Tc_02zkuBQAnUqrjri6XZ3c7w_12_0"></a><a id="Tc_3KvXAZlcHkmL2Yq-K6JndA_13_0"></a><a id="Tc_FR5sTge6F