ix:nonFraction>)</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-left:18pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" name="us-gaap:IntangibleAssetsDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_OUpf6T7bIUyn4hKlhA6EYA" continuedAt="Tb_OUpf6T7bIUyn4hKlhA6EYA_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTE 11. INTANGIBLE ASSETS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Pacsquare Purchase Agreement</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Pursuant to the transactions contemplated by a letter of intent, on February 16, 2024, AtlasClear and Pacsquare entered into a Source Code Purchase Agreement and Master Services Agreement (the &#8220;Pacsquare Purchase Agreement&#8221;), pursuant to which AtlasClear acquired the AtlasClear Platform. Pursuant to the Pacsquare Purchase Agreement, Pacsquare will develop, implement and launch the AtlasClear Platform and provide maintenance and support services as described in the agreement. The Pacsquare Purchase Agreement provides that Pacsquare will develop and deliver to AtlasClear the Level 1 equities trading platform and that it will develop and deliver all modules of the clearing platform within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_aKteM8xuvkS9-Kkb42a66w" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="atch:ThresholdPeriodToReceiveLevel1EquitiesTradingPlatformFromSigningOfAgreement" id="Narr_2Sj1ukU_2kaH-XX4oZLVhg">12 months</ix:nonNumeric> of signing the Pacsquare Purchase Agreement. AtlasClear owns all the intellectual property relating to the AtlasClear Platform, including the software and source code. The Pacsquare Purchase Agreement also granted AtlasClear a right of first refusal to any products or services that relate to trading, settlement, clearance or any other business of AtlasClear that Pacsquare proposes to offer to other persons. The purchase price for the assets was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_aKteM8xuvkS9-Kkb42a66w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionPriceOfAcquisitionExpected" scale="6" id="Narr_7xEGVZf1WkOJfYKTvAWHkw">4.8</ix:nonFraction> million as follows: (i) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_AWoTbLQ5Tk-cd4MCwmS5BA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionPurchaseConsiderationPayableInCashAndSharesOfCommonStock" scale="6" id="Narr_StcrBV5WdUieCQwRucvAeA">1.9</ix:nonFraction> million, consisting of (A) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_AWoTbLQ5Tk-cd4MCwmS5BA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionPurchaseConsiderationPayableInCashUponDeliveryOfSourceCodeAndExecutionOfPurchaseAgreement" scale="0" id="Narr_J0n5mC6h6EeChvKy0tZQNw">100,000</ix:nonFraction> payable in a cash upon delivery of the source code and execution of the Pacsquare Purchase Agreement; (B) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_aKteM8xuvkS9-Kkb42a66w" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestIssuedAndIssuable" scale="0" id="Narr_MUFqbVttT0Sp-Lq5GB6Fxg">850,000</ix:nonFraction> payable in shares of Common Stock at a price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_AWoTbLQ5Tk-cd4MCwmS5BA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_bRK5srwB-UqpS2aIwC03AA">6.00</ix:nonFraction> per share; and (C) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_AWoTbLQ5Tk-cd4MCwmS5BA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionPurchaseConsiderationPayableInFourMonthlyInstallments" scale="0" id="Narr_Ei1T-cI8WkWdLGgPD-EjEA">950,000</ix:nonFraction> to be paid in <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_AWoTbLQ5Tk-cd4MCwmS5BA" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionPurchaseConsiderationPayableInEachMonthlyInstallment" scale="0" id="Narr_lsTxW3YS1E-XqLZBvjVv_w">four</ix:nonFraction> monthly installments of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_AWoTbLQ5Tk-cd4MCwmS5BA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionPurchaseConsiderationNumberOfMonthlyInstallments" scale="0" id="Narr_nW-08y6yrEOrqOy_GFrMtw">237,500</ix:nonFraction>, payable in shares of Common Stock at the price per share on the day of issuance and (ii) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_AWoTbLQ5Tk-cd4MCwmS5BA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionPurchaseConsiderationPayableRatablyOnModuleByModuleBasisUponDeliveryAndAcceptanceOfEachOfPlatformModules" scale="6" id="Narr_SNEx5-G1QUib2G4KJXrjRQ">2.7</ix:nonFraction> million to be paid ratably on a module-by-module basis upon delivery and acceptance of each of the AtlasClear Platform modules. AtlasClear has sole discretion to determine whether any of the foregoing payments will be made in cash or shares of Common Stock. As of June 30, 2024, the Company has issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_5jVCFWgfjEKQsY_ZBIY1Vw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_tiJPDKf7NkWPs0bPN-hXsg">336,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_atch_PurchasePricePerShareAt600Member_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_tknK6K3ZuEiqfuNqIKIWeA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_Tx3T5G1jSkyKDi78LM-neg">141,667</ix:nonFraction> of which were valued at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_atch_PurchasePricePerShareAt600Member_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_tknK6K3ZuEiqfuNqIKIWeA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_moCEPDFwrECbVRC8vYypQg">6</ix:nonFraction> per share as per agreed upon terms and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_atch_PurchasePricePerShareAt150Member_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_6jWlhpo2e0yK5EGcXNqnxw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_qtSX71eEcUuOBeejJ_AF5A">194,333</ix:nonFraction> valued at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_xU9hdqxujEG4Bkjw-edm-A" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_atch_PurchasePricePerShareAt150Member_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_6jWlhpo2e0yK5EGcXNqnxw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_4ShlZ5ydvkqQE3CNkN0ntw">1.50</ix:nonFraction> per share based on the fair value of common stock on March 12, 2024 the date the share were issued to Pacsquare pursuant to the terms of the Pacsquare Purchase Agreement and paid $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2023_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_FeQpiXZjCEWPkF2yzxbqsg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireProductiveAssets" scale="0" id="Narr_oZjgO_LbkUWW6r3LqVUOgg">500,000</ix:nonFraction> in cash and accrued $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_i2gUnkY77UuxcoehQ3RXew" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionAccruedInAccountsPayable" scale="0" id="Narr_7-oTLclMIEmzn1LYX-z58w">85,000</ix:nonFraction> in accounts payable for total carrying value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2023_To_6_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_FeQpiXZjCEWPkF2yzxbqsg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_QMXihikYo0OkIdCWiBjt4Q">1,726,500</ix:nonFraction>. During the three months ended September 30, 2024 the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares__uYNCiLHIkOvp3lBfmdLWw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_aKteM8xuvkS9-Kkb42a66w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesPurchaseOfAssets" scale="0" id="Narr_LO30n0QUvUCFJM23Cm2QFQ">500,000</ix:nonFraction> shares valued at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_aKteM8xuvkS9-Kkb42a66w" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValuePurchaseOfAssets" scale="0" id="Narr_E6jcgKuSKUaD7LcHN3S7hg">122,300</ix:nonFraction> on issuance date to Pacsquare as additional consideration towards the AtlasClear platform and accrued and additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_AWoTbLQ5Tk-cd4MCwmS5BA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="atch:AssetAcquisitionAdditionalConsiderationPayableIncludedInAccruedInvoices" scale="0" id="Narr_6oqOSC-cQ0W_g8UxOJhAOQ">15,000</ix:nonFraction> in accrued invoices received bringing the balance to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_5swrX355mkOebOs5E5ZArA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_atch_PacsquareMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_atch_AtlasclearPlatformMember_AWoTbLQ5Tk-cd4MCwmS5BA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsNet" scale="0" id="Narr_BI5_bpkhFE-Zw9ENOJjmGg">1,928,800</ix:nonFraction> as of September 30, 2024. The AtlasClear platform is not yet in use as such amortization has not yet commenced. The Company anticipates commencing amortization during the quarter ended December 31, 2024.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-61</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">ATLASCLEAR HOLDINGS, INC.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">SEPTEMBER 30, 2024</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><a id="Tc_1dPyurn8n0-QyyeYfdQWiQ_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_GvzwCjy57EWjAikYcNNxiw_2_7"></a><a id="Tc_COMvo5vN00-vf6ji3GnQ3g_2_10"></a><a id="Tc_vslzpotEJkmTOdyrQgPiwA_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_T10GqnoS0EuWswu4K_uvUw_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_SzHPyoJZEESjZ-oE4EnCuA_3_7"></a><a id="Tc_XBDwD4FRq0uzUaigxlaBow_3_10"></a><a id="Tc_GdhcKciRBUKqM3IPNtB8UA_3_13"></a><a id="Tc_CQRw36ZHb0KVxLsfMx2Gcw_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_YWhHkDSu30a0zQwSuUJb-Q_5_2"></a><a id="Tc_KDwE5eyOukmXnZoZH-dVwg_5_4"></a><a id="Tc_E0xvyhHQH0eTvJs2BbjtoQ_5_7"></a><a id="Tc_nU95dnpsGk25ELkSQMATxw_5_8"></a><a id="Tc_iQkMAjXI8U-VXY5Ab7PxwA_5_10"></a><a id="Tc_d6wjH7nljk-8kmM_zI2K2A_5_11"></a><a id="Tc_89RVz2sFvUuDA64Mc-3AYw_5_13"></a><a id="Tc_UrJU326UvkSr6iTJZfX-Sg_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_IrCHFsK7S0Wgl2_mIQrWtw_6_8"></a><a id="Tc_DebU887VBEup7au0TckBDQ_6_11"></a><a id="Tc_-bcVYopwjEa_23PEmkuNrw_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_XXULXsL7KEWwXgjvp68g5A_7_11"></a><a id="Tc_IrVu-XcRvkqAGiRlHkybng_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_U5Y9gT6VGE-PCLuqu_9OWQ_8_4"></a><a id="Tc_nSEBgv149k61pNsRGplSqQ_8_7"></a><a id="Tc_Asb-yDl0lEanAuSK19B0rw_8_10"></a><a id="Tc_6pFLdi_KG0Oknjl-Senxqg_8_13"></a><a id="Tc_e3Q74hDmr06QZ7rW0pnu5A_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_YMVeb4QGA0SX6VJea8kRiA_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_Vuyytr0NtkO_jbmVXy4alA_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_ezqRCgQza0OE5p0s3z-Ksw_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_0IR8X8VKB0-tItF6O6fvoA_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_wKH14cALT0iCcuZxKCq7VA_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_QQrZP_QwgEulJU0y847oMQ_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_KFGNR8qfLEix7Eguxd-XdA_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_MAvYMSSQ2kaWbiqWO4QT0g_7_0"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_OUpf6T7bIUyn4hKlhA6EYA_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Intangible Assets of the company at September 30, 2024, are summarized as follows:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_G_cfyEkcAkCe-k4MlwIprg" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfIndefiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsTableTextBlock" id="Tb_bodSOLEno06aQ9ar08C4Rg" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:44.78%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style